t="1537" data-end="1560">Shivapuri foothills</strong>, near Budhanilkantha, offer a forest-based zipline experience. This location is perfect for those who want to enjoy greenery, fresh air, and a nature-focused adventure without traveling far from the city.</p>\n<p data-start="1767" data-end="1980"><strong data-start="1767" data-end="1779">Pharping</strong> is another nearby destination that combines adventure with cultural surroundings. Ziplining in Pharping gives a unique experience of flying over rural landscapes and open hills in a quiet environment.</p>\n<p data-start="1982" data-end="2197">The <strong data-start="1986" data-end="2001">Kakani area</strong>, located north of Kathmandu, is popular for its cool climate and panoramic views. Zipline activities in Kakani are ideal for travelers seeking a refreshing outdoor adventure in a relaxed setting.</p>\n\n<h3 data-start="2204" data-end="2246">Choose the Best Zipline Near Kathmandu</h3>\n<p data-start="2248" data-end="2562">With zipline locations in <strong data-start="2274" data-end="2358">Nagarkot, Ghyampe Danda, Chandragiri, Dhulikhel, Shivapuri, Pharping, and Kakani</strong>, <b>Ever Peak Adventure</b> offers one of the <strong data-start="2404" data-end="2439">best tour packages in Kathmandu</strong>. These multiple options allow travelers to select the most suitable location based on time, budget, and scenic preference.</p>\n<p data-start="2564" data-end="2721">Whether you want a quick thrill or a scenic adventure, this <strong data-start="2624" data-end="2649">tour package in Nepal</strong> delivers excitement, safety, and unforgettable memories near Kathmandu.</p>\n\n<h3 data-start="1377" data-end="1396">Tour Highlights</h3>\n<ul data-start="1397" data-end="1641">\n \t<li data-start="1397" data-end="1445">\n<p data-start="1399" data-end="1445">One of the best Zipline experiences in Nepal</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="1446" data-end="1505">\n<p data-start="1448" data-end="1505">Stunning views of hills, 