f71080cd-b1bd-45de-a02c-21b022dfdf72	Nepal Classic Tour	nepal-classic-tour	{}	11 Days	March-Jun / Oct-Feb	Nepal	Moderate		Kathmandu	Kathmandu	B.B.	<div>\n<div data-turn-id-container="request-WEB:c8d0ad9e-8b13-489b-b3a4-34506efbf0e2-2" data-is-intersecting="true"><section dir="auto" data-turn-id="request-WEB:c8d0ad9e-8b13-489b-b3a4-34506efbf0e2-2" data-turn-id-container="request-WEB:c8d0ad9e-8b13-489b-b3a4-34506efbf0e2-2" data-testid="conversation-turn-6" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div dir="auto" tabindex="0" data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="a773d9fe-5bc8-446a-8ffc-ef6ce18c8fad" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-5" data-turn-start-message="true">\n<div>\n<div>\n<p data-start="33" data-end="387">Experience the best of Nepal on this unforgettable 11-day Nepal Classic Tour, combining cultural heritage, natural beauty, wildlife adventures, and authentic local experiences. This journey takes you through Nepal’s most iconic destinations, offering a perfect introduction to the country’s rich traditions, breathtaking landscapes, and warm hospitality.</p>\n<p data-start="389" data-end="749">Begin in <strong data-start="398" data-end="411">Kathmandu</strong>, the vibrant capital city, where you will explore ancient temples, sacred shrines, and UNESCO World Heritage Sites while witnessing centuries-old rituals and living cultural traditions. A full-day excursion to <strong data-start="622" data-end="649">Bhaktapur Durbar Square</strong> reveals Nepal’s finest medieval architecture, traditional craftsmanship, and unique Newari culture.</p>\n<p data-start="751" data-end="977">Travel to <strong data-start="761" data-end="786">Chitwan National Park</strong> for an exciting wildlife experience. Enjoy jungle activities, canoe rides, nature walks, and opportunities to spot rare wildlife including the one-horned rhinoceros and various bird species.</p>\n<p data-start="979" data-end="1355">Continue to the beautiful lakeside city of <strong data-start="1022" data-end="1033">Pokhara</strong>, surrounded by the majestic Himalayas. Explore serene Phewa Lake, stunning viewpoints, caves, waterfalls, and enjoy spectacular mountain scenery. From Pokhara, embark on a scenic <strong data-start="1213" data-end="1244">1 Night 2 Days Dhampus Hike</strong>, offering breathtaking views of the Annapurna range, charming Gurung villages, and authentic rural lifestyles.</p>\n<p data-start="1357" data-end="1666">Discover the picturesque hilltop town of <strong data-start="1398" data-end="1410">Bandipur</strong>, renowned for its preserved cultural heritage, traditional architecture, and panoramic mountain views. Later, visit <strong data-start="1527" data-end="1539">Nagarkot</strong>, one of Nepal’s most famous viewpoints, where you can witness unforgettable sunrise and sunset views over the Himalayan peaks.</p>\n<p data-start="1668" data-end="1888">Throughout the journey, you will immerse yourself in Nepal’s diverse cultures, ancient customs, religious ceremonies, local traditions, and daily village life, making this tour a truly enriching and memorable experience.</p>\n<p data-start="1890" data-end="1909"></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section></div>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden="true"></div>	<ul>\n<li data-section-id="1b8smas" data-start="1910" data-end="1959">Explore Kathmandu’s UNESCO World Heritage Sites</li>\n<li data-section-id="yh509l" data-start="1960" data-end="1997">Full-day cultural tour of Bhaktapur</li>\n<li data-section-id="1ufg1cb" data-start="1998" data-end="2047">Experience authentic Hindu and Buddhist rituals</li>\n<li data-section-id="1dhqysi" data-start="2048" data-end="2101">Wildlife safari activities in Chitwan National Park</li>\n<li data-section-id="s6xvg8" data-start="2102" data-end="2149">Discover the beauty of Pokhara and Phewa Lake</li>\n<li data-section-id="jmhyrb" data-start="2150" data-end="2186">Scenic 1 Night 2 Days Dhampus Trek</li>\n<li data-section-id="1o5vfb6" data-start="2187" data-end="2244">Visit traditional Gurung villages and local communities</li>\n<li data-section-id="6r2q10" data-start="2245" data-end="2289">Explore the historic hill town of Bandipur</li>\n<li data-section-id="mn39yn" data-start="2290" data-end="2335">Enjoy Himalayan sunrise views from Nagarkot</li>\n<li data-section-id="wzcmws" data-start="2336" data-end="2423" data-is-last-node="">Experience Nepal’s rich culture, heritage, and local lifestyle throughout the journey</li>\n</ul>\n	[{"day": "1", "desc": "Arrive in Kathmandu, receive a warm welcome, transfer to your hotel, and enjoy a relaxing introduction to Nepal's vibrant culture and heritage.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 1: Ariival at kathmandu "}, {"day": "2", "desc": "Explore Kathmandu's most sacred temples, ancient palaces, and UNESCO World Heritage Sites while experiencing Nepal's rich cultural and religious traditions.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 2: Kathmandu Heritage Sightseeing"}, {"day": "3", "desc": "Journey from the hills of Kathmandu to the subtropical plains of Chitwan and experience the unique culture and natural beauty of Nepal's premier wildlife destination.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 3: Drive to Chitwan National Park"}, {"day": "4", "desc": "Experience the rich wildlife and natural beauty of Chitwan National Park through exciting jungle activities and unforgettable encounters with nature.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 4: Chitwan Jungle Activities"}, {"day": "5", "desc": "Travel to the beautiful lakeside city of Pokhara, renowned for its tranquil atmosphere, stunning mountain views, and natural beauty.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 5: Drive to Pokhara"}, {"day": "6", "desc": "Explore the natural and cultural attractions of Pokhara before hiking to the picturesque village of Dhampus, offering stunning views of the Annapurna Himalayas.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 6: Pokhara Sightseeing &amp; Hike to Dhampus"}, {"day": "7", "desc": "Enjoy a refreshing morning in Dhampus before descending through scenic countryside trails and returning to Pokhara for a relaxing afternoon.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 7: Hike Down to Phedi &amp; Return to Pokhara"}, {"day": "8", "desc": "Travel to the charming hilltop town of Bandipur and discover its well-preserved heritage, traditional architecture, and panoramic mountain views.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 8: Drive to Bandipur"}, {"day": "9", "desc": "Enjoy a scenic drive from Bandipur to Nagarkot, a popular hill station renowned for its breathtaking Himalayan views and peaceful mountain atmosphere.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 9: Drive to Nagarkot"}, {"day": "10", "desc": "Travel back to Kathmandu and explore the ancient city of Bhaktapur, renowned for its rich culture, historic architecture, and timeless charm.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 10: Drive to Kathmandu via Bhaktapur Sightseeing"}, {"day": "11", "desc": "Conclude your memorable journey through Nepal with a transfer to the airport for your onward destination.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 11: Final Departure"}]	<ul>\n<li data-start="22" data-end="71">Airport pick-up and drop-off by private vehicle</li>\n<li data-start="22" data-end="71">3 nights accommodation in Kathmandu with breakfast</li>\n<li data-start="22" data-end="71">2 nights accommodation in Chitwan with breakfast, lunch, and dinner</li>\n<li data-start="22" data-end="71">All jungle activities in Chitwan National Park with a professional naturalist guide</li>\n<li data-start="22" data-end="71">2 nights accommodation in Pokhara with breakfast</li>\n<li data-start="22" data-end="71">1 night accommodation in Bandipur with breakfast</li>\n<li data-start="22" data-end="71">1 night accommodation in Nagarkot with breakfast</li>\n<li data-start="22" data-end="71">1 night accommodation during the Dhampus hike</li>\n<li data-start="22" data-end="71">Experienced English-speaking trekking guide for the Dhampus trek</li>\n<li data-start="22" data-end="71">Annapurna Conservation Area Permit (ACAP)</li>\n<li data-start="22" data-end="71">TIMS (Trekkers' Information Management System) Card</li>\n<li data-start="22" data-end="71">Private transportation for sightseeing and transfers as per itinerary</li>\n<li data-start="22" data-end="71">Full-day guided sightseeing tour of Kathmandu and Bhaktapur</li>\n<li data-start="22" data-end="71">Entrance fees to all listed cultural and heritage sites</li>\n<li data-start="22" data-end="71">All government taxes and service charges</li>\n<li data-start="22" data-end="71">Farewell dinner at a traditional Nepali restaurant</li>\n<li data-start="22" data-end="71">Comprehensive first-aid kit carried by the guide</li>\n<li data-start="22" data-end="71">24/7 assistance from Ever Peak Adventures throughout the trip</li>\n</ul>\n	<div class="qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot">\n<div class="" data-turn-id-container="request-WEB:c8d0ad9e-8b13-489b-b3a4-34506efbf0e2-5" data-is-intersecting="true">\n<section class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" dir="auto" data-turn-id="request-WEB:c8d0ad9e-8b13-489b-b3a4-34506efbf0e2-5" data-turn-id-container="request-WEB:c8d0ad9e-8b13-489b-b3a4-34506efbf0e2-5" data-testid="conversation-turn-12" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant">\n<div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)">\n<div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width: