fade-mask group-data-[expanded-composer-mode-button]/composer:pe-9">\n<p><textarea class="wcDTda_fallbackTextarea" name="prompt-textarea" aria-label="Chat with ChatGPT" data-virtualkeyboard="true"></textarea></p>\n<div id="prompt-textarea" class="ProseMirror" role="textbox" data-virtualkeyboard="true" aria-label="Chat with ChatGPT"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="flex items-center gap-1 [grid-area:trailing]" data-composer-transition-slot="trailing">\n<div class="ms-auto flex items-center gap-2">\n<div id="_r_fe_" class="fixed inset-s-[anchor(center)] inset-e-auto top-[calc(anchor(bottom)+var(--spacing))] bottom-auto h-fit -translate-x-1/2 [position-try-fallbacks:flip-block] flex flex-col overflow-visible bg-transparent z-50" role="tooltip" hidden=""></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class="inline-flex">\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n	[{"day": "1", "desc": "Fly from Kathmandu to Paro, enjoying spectacular Himalayan views along the way. After completing immigration formalities, meet your local guide and begin the scenic drive to Thimphu, Bhutan’s charming capital. Enjoy beautiful mountain landscapes, traditional villages, and peaceful surroundings before checking into your hotel and relaxing for the evening.\\";", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 1: Kathmandu – Paro – Thimphu\\";s:"}, {"day": "2", "desc": "Spend the day exploring Thimphu, Bhutan’s fascinating capital, known for its unique culture and peaceful atmosphere. Visit Buddha Dordenma, Tashichho Dzong, Memorial Chorten, and local landmarks while experiencing Bhutanese traditions and architecture. Enjoy time exploring the city, discovering local handicrafts, and learning about Bhutan’s distinctive way of life.\\";s:", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 2: Thimphu Sightseeing"}, {"day": "3", "desc": "Travel from Thimphu toward Punakha through spectacular mountain scenery and beautiful countryside. Cross the famous Dochula Pass, where you can enjoy panoramic Himalayan views and visit the 108 Druk Wangyal Chortens. Continue through lush valleys and winding roads before reaching historic Punakha, Bhutan’s former capital and cultural heartland.\\";", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 3: Thimphu – Dochula Pass – Punakha\\";s:"}, {"day": "4", "desc": "Leave Punakha and journey toward the peaceful Gangtey Valley, surrounded by beautiful mountains and forests. Visit the impressive Gangtey Monastery and explore the scenic Phobjikha Valley. Enjoy the tranquil countryside, traditional Bhutanese villages, and open landscapes while experiencing a quieter side of Bhutan away from the main towns.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 4: Punakha – Gangtey\\";"}, {"day": "5", "desc": "Depart Gangtey and journey toward the beautiful Paro Valley through scenic mountain roads and peaceful Bhutanese countryside. Enjoy changing landscapes, lush forests, traditional villages, and spectacular Himalayan views along the way. Upon reaching Paro, check into your hotel, relax, and enjoy the serene atmosphere of this historic mountain valley.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 5: Gangtey – Paro\\";"}, {"day": "6", "desc": "Begin your memorable hike to Bhutan’s iconic Tiger’s Nest Monastery, perched dramatically on a cliff above Paro Valley. Walk through beautiful pine forests while enjoying spectacular mountain views and peaceful surroundings. Explore the sacred monastery and ancient temples before descending to Paro, completing one of Bhutan’s most rewarding cultural and scenic experiences.\\";s:23", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 6: Tiger’s Nest Monastery Hike\\";"}, {"day": "7", "desc": "Enjoy your final morning in Bhutan before transferring to Paro International Airport for your flight to Kathmandu. Take in the last views of the beautiful Paro Valley and surrounding mountains. Depart Bhutan with unforgettable memories of its peaceful landscapes, ancient monasteries, rich culture, traditional architecture, and warm hospitality.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 7: Paro – Kathmandu Departure\\";"}]	<ul>\n<li data-section-id="1mswbvw" data-start="26" data-end="70"> Kathmandu–Paro–Kathmandu flight tickets</li>\n<li data-section-id="1t6a5m0" data-start="71" data-end="134"> 6 nights accommodation in carefully selected 4-star hotels</li>\n<li data-section-id="1bce1nb" data-start="135" data-end="168"> Daily breakfast at the hotel</li>\n<li data-section-id="xpn60w" data-start="169" data-end="214"> Private transportation throughout Bhutan</li>\n<li data-section-id="1wbcjbp" data-start="215" data-end="267"> Experienced English-speaking Bhutanese guide</li>\n<li data-section-id="n3fs4j" data-start="268" data-end="332"> Sightseeing and entrance fees as mentioned in the itinerary</li>\n<li data-section-id="2ds9a3" data-start="333" data-end="378"> Tiger’s Nest Monastery hiking experience</li>\n<li data-section-id="w68jf4" data-start="379" data-end="399"> Bhutan visa fee</li>\n<li data-section-id="1opwwzn" data-start="400" data-end="438"> Sustainable Development Fee (SDF)</li>\n<li data-section-id="1gy7jug" data-start="439" data-end="495"> All necessary government taxes and service charges</li>\n<li data-section-id="19lm2kf" data-start="496" data-end="548"> Drinking water during sightseeing and transfers</li>\n<li data-section-id="11mfdbr" data-start="549" data-end="594"> Government-approved local tour services</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start="1405" data-end="1427"></h3>\n	<div class="relative basis-auto flex-col -mb-(--composer-overlap-px) pb-(--composer-overlap-px) [--composer-overlap-px:28px] grow flex">\n<div class="flex min-h-0 grow flex-col text-sm">\n<div class="qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot">\n<div class="" data-turn-id