bottom-auto h-fit -translate-x-1/2 [position-try-fallbacks:flip-block] flex flex-col overflow-visible bg-transparent z-50" role="tooltip" hidden=""></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class="-my-2.5 flex overflow-x-hidden ps-1.75 pe-1.5 [grid-area:primary] group-data-expanded/composer:mb-0 group-data-expanded/composer:ps-2.5 group-data-expanded/composer:pe-2.5 min-h-14 items-center">\n<div class="wcDTda_prosemirror-parent text-token-text-primary max-h-[max(30svh,5rem)] max-h-52 min-h-[var(--deep-research-composer-extra-height,unset)] flex-1 scroll-py-4 overflow-auto [scrollbar-width:thin] default-browser vertical-scroll-fade-mask group-data-[expanded-composer-mode-button]/composer:pe-9">\n<p><textarea class="wcDTda_fallbackTextarea" name="prompt-textarea" aria-label="Chat with ChatGPT" data-virtualkeyboard="true"></textarea></p>\n<div id="prompt-textarea" class="ProseMirror" role="textbox" data-virtualkeyboard="true" aria-label="Chat with ChatGPT"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n	2199	0	2026-08-23 02:08:08.019	2026-08-23 02:08:08.019	\N	<p>Experience the beauty, culture and peaceful Himalayan atmosphere of Bhutan on this carefully designed 7-day tour from Nepal. With six nights in Bhu	\N	\N	\N	https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ChatGPT-Image-Jul-29-2026-11_21_57-AM.png	f	f	\N	\N	\N	<h3 class="PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer" data-section-id="1jvyx2t" data-start="98" data-end="121"></h3>\n<ul data-start="123" data-end="584" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">\n<li data-section-id="lq25sv" data-start="123" data-end="150">Comfortable walking shoes</li>\n<li data-section-id="1nigqqb" data-start="151" data-end="166">Light daypack</li>\n<li data-section-id="11rfapo" data-start="167" data-end="179">Sunglasses</li>\n<li data-section-id="10lx50y" data-start="180" data-end="196">Sun hat or cap</li>\n<li data-section-id="1ncvwls" data-start="197" data-end="221">Sunscreen and lip balm</li>\n<li data-section-id="13vmyk5" data-start="222" data-end="246">Light jacket or fleece</li>\n<li data-section-id="1q88gaz" data-start="247" data-end="266">Waterproof jacket</li>\n<li data-section-id="l2ig7m" data-start="267" data-end="302">Comfortable trousers and T-shirts</li>\n<li data-section-id="1sefx3b" data-start="303" data-end="338">Warm layers for higher elevations</li>\n<li data-section-id="myepya" data-start="339" data-end="362">Reusable water bottle</li>\n<li data-section-id="1vwrh0n" data-start="363" data-end="410">Personal medication and basic first-aid items</li>\n<li data-section-id="1ofrpbx" data-start="411" data-end="450">Camera and extra batteries/power bank</li>\n<li data-section-id="vgwmg7" data-start="451" data-end="467">Travel adapter</li>\n<li data-section-id="1r6xza3" data-start="468" data-end="484">Small umbrella</li>\n<li data-section-id="u62etr" data-start="485" data-end="516">Passport and travel documents</li>\n<li data-section-id="1ouirnm" data-start="517" data-end="584" data-is-last-node="">Comfortable clothes suitable for visiting monasteries and temples</li>\n</ul>\n	\N	\N	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	t	\N	\N	\N
4bd9d003-e8f1-49be-9fd5-cac3f10b01e9	Mount Kailash & Manasarovar Yatra – 13 Days	mount-kailash-tour	{}	13 Days	May–September	Nepal	Moderate		Kathmandu	Kathmandu	B.B.	<p data-start="254" data-end="570">The <strong data-start="258" data-end="295">Mount Kailash &amp; Manasarovar Yatra</strong> is one of the most sacred spiritual journeys in the world, located in the remote western region of <span><span>Tibet</span></span>. Revered by Hindus, Buddhists, Jains, and Bon followers, <span><span>Mount Kailash</span></span> is believed to be the abode of Lord Shiva.</p>\n<p data-start="572" data-end="870">This pilgrimage includes a holy visit to <span><span>Lake Manasarovar</span></span> and a challenging yet rewarding circumambulation (Kora) of Mount Kailash. The journey offers a powerful combination of spiritual fulfillment, cultural exploration, and high-altitude adventure across the Tibetan Plateau.</p>	<ul>\n<li data-section-id="hcsi2z" data-start="896" data-end="958">Sacred pilgrimage to <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Mount Kailash</span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id="9ij8mn" data-start="959" data-end="1012">Holy dip at <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Lake Manasarovar</span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id="1s1l35l" data-start="1013" data-end="1071">Complete Kailash Kora (3-day trek around the mountain)</li>\n<li data-section-id="1tn80qp" data-start="1072" data-end="1123">Cross high mountain passes (Dolma La – 5,630 m)</li>\n<li data-section-id="1j0phac" data-start="1124" data-end="1161">Explore remote Tibetan landscapes</li>\n<li data-section-id="165morj" data-start="1162" data-end="1198">Spiritual and cultural immersion</li>\n<li data-section-id="kk2yv8" data-start="1199" data-end="1245">Visit monasteries and traditional villages</li>\n</ul>\n	[{"day": "1", "desc": "Arrive in Kathmandu and transfer to your hotel. Meet your yatra team and attend a detailed briefing about the Kailash pilgrimage, permits, and preparation. Check your equipment and complete necessary documentation. This day is for rest and mental preparation before beginning the spiritual journey to Tibet.", "elev": 1400, "title": "Day 01: Arrival in Kathmandu (1,400 m)"}, {"day": "2", "desc": "Spend the day preparing for the Kailash Yatra. Complete Chinese visa formalities and permit processing. Finalize trekking gear, clothing, and essential supplies. Attend a comprehensive orientation session conducted by your guide, covering altitude sickness prevention, itinerary details, and safety protocols. This preparation day ensures that all arrangements are in place for a smooth and safe journey ahead.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 02: Kathmandu Preparation &amp; Visa Processing"}, {"day": "3", "desc": "Drive from Kathmandu towards the Nepal–Tibet border via scenic hills and rivers. After completing immigration formalities, enter Tibet and continue to Kerung. Enjoy the transition from lush hills to high-altitude landscapes. Upon arrival, check into your guesthouse and rest. This day marks the beginning of your journey into the Tibetan plateau.\\";", "elev": 2700, "title": "Day 03: Drive Kathmandu  to Kerung (2,700 m)"}, {"day": "4", "desc": "Spend the day acclimatizing to the increasing altitude. Take short hikes around Kerung valley to help your body adjust gradually. Enjoy the peaceful surroundings and observe Tibetan lifestyle. Proper acclimatization reduces the risk of altitude sickness and prepares you for higher elevations in the coming days.", "elev": 2700, "title": "Day 04: Acclimatization Day in Kerung (2,700 m)"}, {"day": "5", "desc": "Drive across the vast Tibetan plateau towards Saga, passing rivers, grasslands, and small settlements. The landscape becomes increasingly rugged and dramatic. This is a significant altitude gain, so move slowly and stay hydrated. Saga is a key stop for acclimatization before reaching higher elevations.", "elev": 4450, "title": "Day 05: Drive Kerung to Saga (4,450 m)"}, {"day": "6", "desc": "Drive to the sacred Lake Manasarovar, one of the holiest lakes in the world. Enjoy breathtaking views of Mount Kailash from a distance. Upon arrival, perform spiritual rituals, meditation, and optional holy bath. The serene environment offers deep spiritual peace and reflection.", "elev": 4590, "title": "Day 06: Drive Saga to Lake Manasarovar (4,590 m)"}, {"day": "7", "desc": "Short drive to Darchen, the base camp of Mount Kailash. Prepare for the upcoming Kora (circumambulation). Rest, organize belongings, and pack essentials for trekking. This is a crucial preparation day before starting the physically demanding Kora.", "elev": 4670, "title": "Day 07: Manasarovar to Darchen (4,670 m)"}, {"day": "8", "desc": "Begin the Kailash Kora, trekking alongside stunning views of Mount Kailash’s north face. The trail follows a gradual ascent along a valley. This day offers breathtaking scenery and spiritual significance as you approach the sacred mountain.\\";", "elev": 4900, "title": "Day 08: Trek Darchen to Dirapuk (4,900 m)"}, {"day": "9", "desc": "The most challenging day of the Kora, crossing Dolma La Pass (5,630 m). The ascent is steep and demanding, but spiritually rewarding. Descend towards Zuthulpuk after crossing the pass. This day is both physically intense and spiritually transformative.", "elev": 5630, "title": "Day 09: Trek Dirapuk to Dolma La to Zuthulpuk (5,630 m)"}, {"day": "10", "desc": "Complete the final section of the Kora with a gentle descent back to Darchen. Celebrate the successful completion of this sacred pilgrimage. Rest and recover after the physically demanding journey.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 10: Trek Zuthulpuk  to Darchen"}, {"day": "11", "desc": "Drive back towards Saga, retracing your route across the Tibetan plateau. Enjoy the landscapes once more and relax after the trekking experience.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 11: Drive Darchen to Saga"}, {"day": "12", "desc": "Continue the return journey towards Kerung. Descend gradually, making the journey more comfortable as oxygen levels improve.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 12: Drive Saga to Kerung"}, {"day": "13", "desc": "Cross the border back into Nepal and drive to Kathmandu. Enjoy the transition from Tibetan plateau to lush green hills of Nepal. Transfer to your hotel.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 13: Drive Kerung to Kathmandu"}]	<ul>\n<li data-section-id="yhvp33" data-start="1585" data-end="1634">Tibet Travel Permit &amp; Kailash special permits</li>\n<li data-section-id="14iwjbm" data-start="1635" data-end="1664">Airport pickup &amp; drop-off</li>\n<li data-section-id="ppe9b7" data-start="1665" data-end="1712">Hotel accommodation in Kathmandu (BB basis)</li>\n<li data-section-id="dk5q97" data-start="1713" data-end="1754">Guesthouse/lodge during Tibet journey</li>\n<li data-section-id="j9p7lh" data-start="1755" data-end="1801">All meals during Kailash yatra (Veg meals)</li>\n<li data-section-id="15mb2xv" data-start="1802" data-end="1836">Private vehicle transportation</li>\n<li data-section-id="11oanq0" data-start="1837" data-end="1867">Professional Tibetan guide</li>\n<li data-section-id="14d3lwr" data-start="1868" data-end="1907">Supporting staff &amp; yatra management</li>\n<li data-section-id="14ge675" data-start="1908" data-end="1942">Yak/porter support during Kora</li>\n<li data-section-id="1gnejw8" data-start="1943" data-end="1964">All entrance fees</li>\n<li data-section-id="1hsoxc6" data-start="1965" data-end="1985">Government taxes</li>\n</ul>\n	<ul>\n<li data-section-id="sckugo" data-start="2017" data-end="2042">International airfare</li>\n<li data-section-id="1gvqe0e" data-start="2043" data-end="2061">China visa fee</li>\n<li data-section-id="3fbgzg" data-start="2062" data-end="2094">Travel insurance (mandatory)</li>\n<li data-section-id="1fc0b8z" data-start="2095" data-end="2116">Personal expenses</li>\n<li data-section-id="eghf9a" data-start="2117" data-end="2141">Tips for guide/staff</li>\n<li data-section-id="8nuad9" data-start="2142" data-end="2167">Emergency rescue cost</li>\n<li data-section-id="1jtcan6" data-start="2168" data-end="2194">Personal trekking gear</li>\n</ul>\n	0	0	2026-08-23 02:08:08.019	2026-08-23 02:08:08.019	\N	<p data-start="254" data-end="570">The <strong data-start="258" data-end="295">Mount Kailash &amp; Manasarovar Yatra</strong> is one of the most sacre	\N	\N	\N	https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Golden-Triangle-India-Tour.jpg	f	f	\N	\N	\N	<ul>\n<li data-section-id="jjsx3v" data-start="2240" data-end="2271">Down jacket &amp; warm clothing</li>\n<li data-section-id="8v1aui" data-start="2272" data-end="2298">Trekking shoes &amp; poles</li>\n<li data-section-id="6eehh8" data-start="2299" data-end="2331">Sleeping bag (high altitude)</li>\n<li data-section-id="1mp49jy" data-start="2332" data-end="2358">Sunglasses &amp; sunscreen</li>\n<li data-section-id="1ocloq7" data-start="2359" data-end="2401">Personal medicines (altitude sickness)</li>\n<li data-section-id="126bwsl" data-start="2402" data-end="2428">Water bottle &amp; thermos</li>\n<li data-section-id="icpj71" data-start="2429" data-end="2446">Energy snacks</li>\n</ul>\n	\N	\N	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	t	\N	\N	\N
99ceb7eb-8788-4854-bf72-47cf0320ea1f	Kathmandu Valley Cultural Tour	kathmandu-valley-cultural-tour	{}	3 Days	October – March	Nepal	Moderate		Kathmandu	Kathmandu	B.B.	<p data-start="189" data-end="551">The <strong data-start="193" data-end="227">Kathmandu Valley Cultural Tour</strong> is a fascinating journey through the cultural, historical, and spiritual heritage of Nepal. This tour explores the three ancient cities of <span><span>Kathmandu</span></span>, <span><span>Bhaktapur</span></span>, and <span><span>Patan</span></span>—each known for its unique architecture, temples, and traditions.</p>\n<p data-start="553" data-end="934">You will visit UNESCO World Heritage Sites, including sacred temples, stupas, and royal palaces. The tour offers a perfect blend of history, art, culture, and local lifestyle, making it ideal for travelers who want to experience Nepal beyond trekking. With expert guides, comfortable transportation, and well-planned sightseeing, this tour delivers a memorable cultural experience.</p>	<ul data-start="957" data-end="1389">\n<li data-section-id="37pvlw" data-start="1017" data-end="1064">Visit <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Pashupatinath Temple</span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id="om5ffq" data-start="1065" data-end="1115">Discover <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Boudhanath Stupa</span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id="fccsi6" data-start="1116" data-end="1201">Experience medieval art and architecture in <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Bhaktapur</span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id="mj427g" data-start="1202" data-end="1251">Explore <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Patan Durbar Square</span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id="1bw5q6c" data-start="1252" data-end="1299">Visit <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Swayambhunath Stupa</span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id="1vehlm4" data-start="1300" data-end="1347">Cultural interaction with local communities</li>\n<li data-section-id="rwhl0g" data-start="1348" data-end="1389">Perfect short tour for all age groups</li>\n</ul>\n	[{"day": "1", "desc": "Arrive in Kathmandu where our representative will welcome you and transfer you to your hotel. After check-in, relax or explore the vibrant streets of Thamel. In the evening, attend a short briefing about the cultural tour. This day is mainly for rest, preparation, and introduction to Nepal’s cultural environment.\\";", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 01: Arrival in Kathmandu &amp; Tour Preparation"}, {"day": "2", "desc": "Today, explore major cultural landmarks in Kathmandu including Pashupatinath Temple, Boudhanath Stupa, and Swayambhunath Stupa. Experience Nepal’s religious diversity, ancient architecture, and vibrant traditions while learning from your professional guide.\\";", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 02: Kathmandu City Sightseeing Tour"}, {"day": "3", "desc": "Visit Patan Durbar Square and explore its rich artistic heritage. Continue to Bhaktapur, known for traditional culture, temples, and local craftsmanship. After sightseeing, transfer to the airport for your departure.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 03: Patan &amp; Bhaktapur Tour + Departure"}]	<ul data-start="1419" data-end="1678">\n<li data-section-id="14iwjbm" data-start="1419" data-end="1448">Airport pickup &amp; drop-off</li>\n<li data-section-id="tftijv" data-start="1449" data-end="1490">3-star hotel accommodation (BB basis)</li>\n<li data-section-id="58c038" data-start="1491" data-end="1526">Private vehicle for sightseeing</li>\n<li data-section-id="v5ene" data-start="1527" data-end="1566">Professional English-speaking guide</li>\n<li data-section-id="fl2lmx" data-start="1567" data-end="1603">All sightseeing as per itinerary</li>\n<li data-section-id="1b55flg" data-start="1604" data-end="1642">Government taxes &amp; service charges</li>\n<li data-section-id="12kzq63" data-start="1643" data-end="1678">Entrance fees to heritage sites</li>\n</ul>\n	<ul data-start="1707" data-end="1887">\n<li data-section-id="sckugo" data-start="1707" data-end="1732">International airfare</li>\n<li data-section-id="116xcid" data-start="1733" data-end="1751">Nepal visa fee</li>\n<li data-section-id="1gecbsa" data-start="1752" data-end="1772">Travel insurance</li>\n<li data-section-id="t5gxsj" data-start="1773" data-end="1819">Personal expenses (shopping, drinks, etc.)</li>\n<li data-section-id="1be9l0o" data-start="1820" data-end="1838">Lunch &amp; dinner</li>\n<li data-section-id="50jr5y" data-start="1839" data-end="1864">Tips for guide/driver</li>\n<li data-section-id="eep6w7" data-start="1865" data-end="1887">Extra hotel nights</li>\n</ul>\n	0	0	2026-08-23 02:08:08.019	2026-08-23 02:08:08.019	\N	<p data-start="189" data-end="551">The <strong data-start="193" data-end="227">Kathmandu Valley Cultural Tour</strong> is a fascinating journey throug	\N	\N	\N	https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Kathmandu3.jpg	f	f	\N	\N	\N	<ul>\n<li data-section-id="40v7fj" data-start="2011" data-end="2040">Comfortable walking shoes</li>\n<li data-section-id="2k28jn" data-start="2041" data-end="2070">Light clothing (seasonal)</li>\n<li data-section-id="1mp49jy" data-start="2071" data-end="2097">Sunglasses &amp; sunscreen</li>\n<li data-section-id="1nfupft" data-start="2098" data-end="2122">Camera or smartphone</li>\n<li data-section-id="6dl1ug" data-start="2123" data-end="2147">Personal medications</li>\n<li data-section-id="v5wqrd" data-start="2148" data-end="2164">Water bottle</li>\n<li data-section-id="i2r4hb" data-start="2165" data-end="2191">Small backpack/daypack</li>\n</ul>\n	\N	\N	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	