25bf66d5-1e31-46d7-bb5c-592993a68ad3	Pokhara City & Nature Tour	pokhara-city-nature-tour	{}	4 Days	All year round	Nepal	Moderate		Kathmandu	Kathmandu	B.B.	<p data-start="179" data-end="459">The <strong data-start="183" data-end="213">Pokhara City &amp; Nature Tour</strong> is a relaxing and scenic journey into Nepal’s most beautiful lakeside city, <span><span>Pokhara</span></span>. Surrounded by the Annapurna mountain range, Pokhara offers a perfect blend of natural beauty, adventure, and cultural experiences.</p>\n<p data-start="461" data-end="780">This tour includes visits to serene lakes, caves, waterfalls, and stunning viewpoints like Sarangkot. Travelers can enjoy breathtaking views of <span><span>Machhapuchhre</span></span>, Annapurna, and Dhaulagiri ranges. Ideal for all age groups, this tour is perfect for relaxation, photography, and short holiday escapes.</p>	<ul>\n<li data-section-id="15qb08t" data-start="803" data-end="862">Explore beautiful <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Phewa Lake</span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id="u9hyi3" data-start="863" data-end="922">Sunrise view from <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Sarangkot</span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id="ttjbz8" data-start="923" data-end="970">Visit <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Davis Falls</span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id="1d7etjg" data-start="971" data-end="1020">Explore <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Gupteshwor Mahadev Cave</span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id="114azch" data-start="1021" data-end="1098">Stunning views of <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Machhapuchhre</span></span> &amp; Annapurna range</li>\n<li data-section-id="1dou6uf" data-start="1099" data-end="1135">Boating experience on Phewa Lake</li>\n<li data-section-id="14vqu4c" data-start="1136" data-end="1168">Relaxing lakeside atmosphere</li>\n<li data-section-id="1b4m8yv" data-start="1169" data-end="1225">Optional adventure activities (paragliding, zipline)</li>\n</ul>\n	[{"day": "1", "desc": "Travel from Kathmandu to Pokhara by scenic drive or short flight. Upon arrival, transfer to your hotel near Lakeside. Spend the rest of the day relaxing, enjoying the peaceful atmosphere, and exploring the lakeside market. Pokhara’s calm environment and stunning mountain backdrop make it an ideal destination to unwind and prepare for the upcoming sightseeing experience.\\";", "elev": 822, "title": "Day 01: Arrival in Pokhara (822 m)"}, {"day": "2", "desc": "Enjoy a guided city tour covering major attractions including Davis Falls, Gupteshwor Mahadev Cave, and Phewa Lake. Experience boating on the lake and visit nearby temples. The tour offers a perfect mix of natural beauty and cultural sites.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 02: Pokhara City Sightseeing Tour"}, {"day": "3", "desc": "Early morning drive to Sarangkot to witness a spectacular sunrise over the Annapurna range and Machhapuchhre. After returning to the hotel, spend the day at leisure or enjoy optional adventure activities such as paragliding or ziplining.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 03: Sarangkot Sunrise &amp; Leisure Day"}, {"day": "4", "desc": "Return to Kathmandu by flight or road. Depending on your schedule, transfer to the airport for your final departure or extend your stay in Nepal.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 04: Return to Kathmandu &amp; Departure"}]	<ul data-start="1564" data-end="1836">\n<li data-section-id="14iwjbm" data-start="1564" data-end="1593">Airport pickup &amp; drop-off</li>\n<li data-section-id="1pazwe9" data-start="1594" data-end="1628">Hotel accommodation (BB basis)</li>\n<li data-section-id="vdfc8k" data-start="1629" data-end="1684">Tourist bus or flight (Kathmandu–Pokhara–Kathmandu)</li>\n<li data-section-id="58c038" data-start="1685" data-end="1720">Private vehicle for sightseeing</li>\n<li data-section-id="v5ene" data-start="1721" data-end="1760">Professional English-speaking guide</li>\n<li data-section-id="fl2lmx" data-start="1761" data-end="1797">All sightseeing as per itinerary</li>\n<li data-section-id="1b55flg" data-start="1798" data-end="1836">Government taxes &amp; service charges</li>\n</ul>\n	<ul data-start="1865" data-end="2078">\n<li data-section-id="sckugo" data-start="1865" data-end="1890">International airfare</li>\n<li data-section-id="116xcid" data-start="1891" data-end="1909">Nepal visa fee</li>\n<li data-section-id="1gecbsa" data-start="1910" data-end="1930">Travel insurance</li>\n<li data-section-id="1be9l0o" data-start="1931" data-end="1949">Lunch &amp; dinner</li>\n<li data-section-id="i12pz7" data-start="1950" data-end="1990">Personal expenses (shopping, drinks)</li>\n<li data-section-id="1q8cnk7" data-start="1991" data-end="2052">Adventure activities (paragliding, boating fees optional)</li>\n<li data-section-id="50jr5y" data-start="2053" data-end="2078">Tips for guide/driver</li>\n</ul>\n	0	0	2026-08-23 02:08:08.019	2026-08-23 02:08:08.019	\N	<p data-start="179" data-end="459">The <strong data-start="183" data-end="213">Pokhara City &amp; Nature Tour</strong> is a relaxing and scenic journe	\N	\N	\N	https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Pokhara-City-Nature-Tour1.png	f	f	\N	\N	\N	<ul data-start="2121" data-end="2292">\n<li data-section-id="40v7fj" data-start="2121" data-end="2150">Comfortable walking shoes</li>\n<li data-section-id="2k28jn" data-start="2151" data-end="2180">Light clothing (seasonal)</li>\n<li data-section-id="1mp49jy" data-start="2181" data-end="2207">Sunglasses &amp; sunscreen</li>\n<li data-section-id="1ov3723" data-start="2208" data-end="2231">Camera / smartphone</li>\n<li data-section-id="6dl1ug" data-start="2232" data-end="2256">Personal medications</li>\n<li data-section-id="v5wqrd" data-start="2257" data-end="2273">Water bottle</li>\n<li data-section-id="11p2dfp" data-start="2274" data-end="2292">Small backpack</li>\n</ul>\n	\N	\N	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	t	\N	\N	\N
4e07c627-2828-4335-88bd-a52363a063f7	Nepal Heritage & Wildlife Safari Tour	chitwan-national-park-jungle-safari-tour	{}	8 Days	March-May/October-December	Nepal	Moderate		Kathmandu	Kathmandu	B.B.	Overview\n\nEmbark on an unforgettable journey through Nepal's rich cultural heritage and remarkable wildlife habitats with this Heritage and Wildlife Safari Tour. Combining ancient cities, UNESCO World Heritage Sites, and two of Nepal's most celebrated national parks, this tour offers the perfect blend of culture, nature, and adventure.\n\nBegin your experience in Kathmandu, the historic capital of Nepal, where centuries-old temples, sacred shrines, and vibrant local traditions provide a fascinating introduction to the country's cultural heritage. Explore iconic landmarks and immerse yourself in the unique atmosphere of the Kathmandu Valley before heading into Nepal's southern lowlands.\n\nContinue to Chitwan National Park, a UNESCO World Heritage Site renowned for its diverse wildlife and subtropical jungle landscapes. Enjoy exciting jungle activities including jeep safaris, canoe rides, nature walks, and opportunities to spot the endangered one-horned rhinoceros, crocodiles, deer, and numerous bird species.\n\nThe adventure then takes you to Bardiya National Park, Nepal's most pristine national park. Less crowded and more remote than Chitwan, Bardiya offers exceptional wildlife experiences and some of the best opportunities in Nepal to encounter Bengal tigers, wild elephants, rhinoceroses, and a wide variety of birds in their natural habitat. Explore dense forests, river ecosystems, and traditional Tharu communities while enjoying authentic wilderness experiences.\n\nConclude your journey with a final night in Kathmandu, allowing time for relaxation, last-minute shopping, or further exploration before your departure. This carefully designed itinerary offers an enriching combination of Nepal's cultural treasures and extraordinary wildlife, making it ideal for travelers seeking both heritage discovery and safari adventure.\n<p data-start="595" data-end="864"></p>	<ul>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">Explore the cultural and spiritual landmarks of Kathmandu Valley.</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">Visit UNESCO World Heritage Sites and ancient heritage monuments.</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">Enjoy thrilling jungle safaris in Chitwan National Park.</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">Spot one-horned rhinoceroses, crocodiles, deer, and exotic birdlife.</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">Experience authentic Tharu culture and traditions.</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">Discover the pristine wilderness of Bardiya National Park.</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">Search for the elusive Royal Bengal Tiger and other wildlife.</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">Enjoy guided nature walks, jeep safaris, and bird-watching activities.</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">Experience the perfect blend of heritage, wildlife, and adventure.</li>\n</ul>\n	[{"day": "1", "desc": "Arrive in Kathmandu and begin your Heritage & Wildlife Safari Tour with a warm welcome and introduction to Nepal's rich culture and natural wonders.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 1: Arrival in Kathmandu"}, {"day": "2", "desc": "Explore Kathmandu's most iconic cultural and religious landmarks while discovering the rich heritage of Nepal's historic capital.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 2: Kathmandu Heritage Sightseeing"}, {"day": "3", "desc": "Travel from Kathmandu to Chitwan National Park and experience the unique culture and natural beauty of Nepal's renowned wildlife destination.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 3: Drive to Chitwan National Park"}, {"day": "4", "desc": "Experience the incredible wildlife and natural beauty of Chitwan National Park through exciting safari activities and jungle exploration.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 4: Chitwan Wildlife Safari"}, {"day": "5", "desc": "Journey to Bardiya National Park and experience the untouched wilderness of Nepal's largest and most pristine wildlife sanctuary.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 5: Transfer to Bardiya National Park"}, {"day": "6", "desc": "Venture deep into the wilderness of Bardiya National Park and search for some of Nepal's most iconic wildlife species.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 6: Full-Day Bardiya Jungle Safari"}, {"day": "7", "desc": "Immerse yourself in the untouched wilderness of Bardiya through guided jungle walks and wildlife exploration activities.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 7: Bardiya Wildlife Exploration"}, {"day": "8", "desc": "Leave the wilderness behind and return to Kathmandu, where you can relax, explore the city, or enjoy some last-minute shopping.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 8: Return to Kathmandu"}, {"day": "9", "desc": "Conclude your Heritage & Wildlife Safari Tour with a transfer to the airport for your onward journey.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 9: Final Departure"}]	<ul>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">Airport transfers in Kathmandu (arrival and departure)</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">Accommodation as per the itinerary</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">Breakfast in Kathmandu</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">Full-board meals during Chitwan and Bardiya stays</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">Private transportation throughout the tour</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">Guided sightseeing tour in Kathmandu</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">All jungle activities in Chitwan National Park</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">All jungle activities in Bardiya National Park</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">Experienced English-speaking guides</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">National park entrance fees and conservation permits</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">Government taxes and service charges</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n	<ul>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">International airfare</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">Nepal entry visa fees</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">Travel insurance</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">Lunch and dinner in Kathmandu</li>\n<li class="isSelectedEnd">Personal expenses (laundry, telephone, drinks, etc.)