2e171e60-4f56-4829-9d79-68d02deaf630	Kathmandu–Pokhara–Chitwan Golden Triangle Tour	kathmandu-pokhara-chitwan-golden-triangle-tour	{}	7 Days	All year round	Nepal	Moderate		Kathmandu	Kathmandu	B.B.	<p data-start="229" data-end="614">The <strong data-start="233" data-end="283">Kathmandu–Pokhara–Chitwan Golden Triangle Tour</strong> is Nepal’s most popular multi-destination travel package, offering a perfect blend of culture, nature, and wildlife. This journey covers the historical heritage of <span><span>Kathmandu</span></span>, the scenic beauty of <span><span>Pokhara</span></span>, and the rich biodiversity of <span><span>Chitwan National Park</span></span>.</p>\n<p data-start="616" data-end="923">This tour is ideal for first-time visitors who want to experience Nepal’s diversity in a short time—UNESCO heritage sites, Himalayan views, peaceful lakes, and thrilling jungle safaris. With comfortable accommodation, guided tours, and smooth transportation, it delivers a complete Nepal holiday experience.</p>	<ul data-start="946" data-end="1420">\n<li data-section-id="15cjsk1" data-start="946" data-end="1026">Explore UNESCO World Heritage Sites in <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Kathmandu</span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id="5z3qan" data-start="1027" data-end="1114">Visit <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Pashupatinath Temple</span></span> &amp; <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Boudhanath Stupa</span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id="1tdwljj" data-start="1115" data-end="1173">Enjoy boating at <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Phewa Lake</span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id="1km65wr" data-start="1174" data-end="1233">Sunrise view from <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Sarangkot</span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id="m18g5f" data-start="1234" data-end="1292">Jungle safari in <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Chitwan National Park</span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id="s08wkd" data-start="1293" data-end="1332">Tharu cultural dance &amp; village tour</li>\n<li data-section-id="857r8e" data-start="1333" data-end="1374">Scenic drive through hills and rivers</li>\n<li data-section-id="rwe7xd" data-start="1375" data-end="1420">Perfect mix of culture, nature &amp; wildlife</li>\n</ul>\n	[{"day": "1", "desc": "Arrive in Kathmandu where our team will welcome you and transfer you to your hotel. After check-in, relax or explore the vibrant streets of Thamel. In the evening, attend a short tour briefing about your upcoming Golden Triangle journey covering Kathmandu, Pokhara, and Chitwan.", "elev": 1400, "title": "Day 01: Arrival in Kathmandu (1,400 m)"}, {"day": "2", "desc": "Explore cultural landmarks including Pashupatinath Temple, Boudhanath Stupa, and Swayambhunath Stupa. Experience Nepal’s rich heritage and religious diversity.\\";", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 02: Kathmandu Sightseeing Tour"}, {"day": "3", "desc": "Drive to Chitwan enjoying scenic landscapes. Upon arrival, check into your jungle resort and enjoy a village tour followed by a Tharu cultural dance.", "elev": 415, "title": "Day 03: Drive Kathmandu  to Chitwan (415 m)"}, {"day": "4", "desc": "Spend an exciting day exploring the wilderness of Chitwan National Park. Begin with a canoe ride along the Rapti River where you can spot crocodiles and aquatic birds. Continue with a guided jungle walk and jeep safari through dense forests and grasslands. You may encounter rhinos, deer, monkeys, and, if lucky, the Bengal tiger. Visit the elephant breeding center and learn about conservation efforts.", "elev": 415, "title": "Day 04: Full Day Jungle Safari Activities in Chitwan (415 m)"}, {"day": "5", "desc": "After breakfast, depart from Chitwan and drive towards Pokhara through scenic countryside, rivers, and hillside landscapes. Enjoy the changing terrain as you leave the subtropical plains and enter the hilly region. Upon arrival in Pokhara, check into your hotel near Lakeside and relax. In the evening, take a peaceful walk along Phewa Lake and enjoy the tranquil environment.", "elev": 822, "title": "Day 05: Drive Chitwan to Pokhara (822 m)"}, {"day": "6", "desc": "Start early morning with a drive to Sarangkot to witness a breathtaking sunrise over the Annapurna range and Machhapuchhre. After breakfast, continue your sightseeing tour visiting Davis Falls, Gupteshwor Cave, and Phewa Lake. Enjoy boating and explore local markets in the Lakeside area.", "elev": 1600, "title": "Day 06: Pokhara Sightseeing &amp; Sarangkot Sunrise (1,600 m)"}, {"day": "7", "desc": "After breakfast, return to Kathmandu by scenic drive or short domestic flight. Enjoy beautiful views of rivers, hills, and rural landscapes during the journey. Upon arrival, you will be transferred to the airport for your final departure or hotel if you plan to extend your stay. This marks the end of your memorable Golden Triangle Tour in Nepal.", "elev": 1400, "title": "Day 07: Return to Kathmandu &amp; Departure (1,400 m)"}]	<ul>\n<li data-section-id="14iwjbm" data-start="1737" data-end="1766">Airport pickup &amp; drop-off</li>\n<li data-section-id="8umfam" data-start="1767" data-end="1820">Hotel accommodation (Kathmandu, Pokhara, Chitwan)</li>\n<li data-section-id="bl4w56" data-start="1821" data-end="1869">Tourist bus / private vehicle transportation</li>\n<li data-section-id="11ok3ba" data-start="1870" data-end="1915">Sightseeing tours with professional guide</li>\n<li data-section-id="1a8jzjv" data-start="1916" data-end="1955">Jungle safari activities in Chitwan</li>\n<li data-section-id="1ja453x" data-start="1956" data-end="1988">All meals in Chitwan (B/L/D)</li>\n<li data-section-id="1sjc75p" data-start="1989" data-end="2025">Breakfast in Kathmandu &amp; Pokhara</li>\n<li data-section-id="1nlbrpm" data-start="2026" data-end="2054">All permits &amp; entry fees</li>\n<li data-section-id="1b55flg" data-start="2055" data-end="2093">Government taxes &amp; service charges</li>\n</ul>\n	<ul>\n<li data-section-id="sckugo" data-start="2122" data-end="2147">International airfare</li>\n<li data-section-id="116xcid" data-start="2148" data-end="2166">Nepal visa fee</li>\n<li data-section-id="1gecbsa" data-start="2167" data-end="2187">Travel insurance</li>\n<li data-section-id="3bg2ec" data-start="2188" data-end="2228">Lunch &amp; dinner (Kathmandu &amp; Pokhara)</li>\n<li data-section-id="i12pz7" data-start="2229" data-end="2269">Personal expenses (shopping, drinks)</li>\n<li data-section-id="50jr5y" data-start="2270" data-end="2295">Tips for guide/driver</li>\n<li data-section-id="15jqcyx" data-start="2296" data-end="2347">Optional activities (paragliding, boating fees)</li>\n</ul>\n	0	0	2026-08-23 02:08:08.019	2026-08-23 02:08:08.019	\N	<p data-start="229" data-end="614">The <strong data-start="233" data-end="283">Kathmandu–Pokhara–Chitwan Golden Triangle Tour</strong> is Nepal’s most	\N	\N	\N	https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Kathmandu–Pokhara–Chitwan-Tour1.png	f	f	\N	\N	\N	<ul data-start="2390" data-end="2567">\n<li data-section-id="40v7fj" data-start="2390" data-end="2419">Comfortable walking shoes</li>\n<li data-section-id="1l51kn6" data-start="2420" data-end="2447">Light seasonal clothing</li>\n<li data-section-id="1mp49jy" data-start="2448" data-end="2474">Sunglasses &amp; sunscreen</li>\n<li data-section-id="1ov3723" data-start="2475" data-end="2498">Camera / smartphone</li>\n<li data-section-id="6dl1ug" data-start="2499" data-end="2523">Personal medications</li>\n<li data-section-id="1b9yya" data-start="2524"