5cf0099d-dea9-4b54-90e1-1fb5d718c65e	Everest Mountain Flight Tour	everest-mountain-flight-tour	{}	1 Day (2-3 Hour Flight)	Spring &amp; Autumn (clear weather)	Nepal	Moderate		Kathmandu	Kathmandu	B.B.	<p data-start="204" data-end="562">The <strong data-start="208" data-end="240">Everest Mountain Flight Tour</strong> is a once-in-a-lifetime aerial experience that offers breathtaking views of the Himalayan range, including the world’s highest peak, <span><span>Mount Everest</span></span>. This short yet spectacular flight departs from <span><span>Kathmandu</span></span> and takes you close to the majestic peaks of the Everest region.</p>\n<p data-start="564" data-end="837">Ideal for travelers with limited time or those who prefer a comfortable alternative to trekking, this tour provides panoramic views of snow-capped mountains, glaciers, and valleys from the comfort of a window seat. It is one of the most popular luxury experiences in Nepal.</p>	<ul data-start="860" data-end="1213">\n<li data-section-id="1ma4v5p" data-start="860" data-end="896">Scenic flight over the Himalayas</li>\n<li data-section-id="dg963z" data-start="897" data-end="955">Close-up view of <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Mount Everest</span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id="mb07of" data-start="956" data-end="1019">Panoramic views of Lhotse, Nuptse, Ama Dablam &amp; other peaks</li>\n<li data-section-id="1n8yuqd" data-start="1020" data-end="1066">Guaranteed window seat for every passenger</li>\n<li data-section-id="gib5dm" data-start="1067" data-end="1101">Aerial photography opportunity</li>\n<li data-section-id="1y7z75a" data-start="1102" data-end="1141">Short and time-efficient experience</li>\n<li data-section-id="kwyldk" data-start="1142" data-end="1170">Ideal for all age groups</li>\n<li data-section-id="zdo2pe" data-start="1171" data-end="1213">Certificate of completion from airline</li>\n</ul>\n	[{"day": "1", "desc": "Early morning transfer to the domestic terminal of Tribhuvan International Airport for your Everest mountain flight. Board a small aircraft and enjoy a spectacular one-hour flight over the Himalayas. Witness breathtaking views of Mount Everest and surrounding peaks, glaciers, and valleys. Each passenger gets a window seat, and pilots provide information about the mountains during the flight.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 01: Everest Mountain Flight Experience"}]	<ul data-start="1576" data-end="1763">\n<li data-section-id="w68j2p" data-start="1576" data-end="1619">Airport transfers (hotel–airport–hotel)</li>\n<li data-section-id="u7s09v" data-start="1620" data-end="1652">Everest scenic flight ticket</li>\n<li data-section-id="rjp0ql" data-start="1653" data-end="1678">Window seat guarantee</li>\n<li data-section-id="1kiv3fx" data-start="1679" data-end="1701">Airport assistance</li>\n<li data-section-id="1b55flg" data-start="1702" data-end="1740">Government taxes &amp; service charges</li>\n<li data-section-id="1di55r9" data-start="1741" data-end="1763">Flight certificate</li>\n</ul>\n	<ul data-start="1792" data-end="1907">\n<li data-section-id="sckugo" data-start="1792" data-end="1817">International airfare</li>\n<li data-section-id="116xcid" data-start="1818" data-end="1836">Nepal visa fee</li>\n<li data-section-id="1gecbsa" data-start="1837" data-end="1857">Travel insurance</li>\n<li data-section-id="1fc0b8z" data-start="1858" data-end="1879">Personal expenses</li>\n<li data-section-id="m5ohgx" data-start="1880" data-end="1898">Meals &amp; drinks</li>\n<li data-section-id="5lwql2" data-start="1899" data-end="1907">Tips</li>\n</ul>\n	1399	0	2026-08-23 02:08:08.019	2026-08-23 02:08:08.019	\N	<p data-start="204" data-end="562">The <strong data-start="208" data-end="240">Everest Mountain Flight Tour</strong> is a once-in-a-lifetime aerial ex	\N	\N	\N	https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/everestmountain-flight.jpg	f	f	\N	\N	\N	<ul data-start="1950" data-end="2088">\n<li data-section-id="1yssvdl" data-start="1950" data-end="1990">Warm clothing (early morning flight)</li>\n<li data-section-id="1uqnbwc" data-start="1991" data-end="2005">Sunglasses</li>\n<li data-section-id="1ov3723" data-start="2006" data-end="2029">Camera / smartphone</li>\n<li data-section-id="9umf8e" data-start="2030" data-end="2064">Passport (required at airport)</li>\n<li data-section-id="18v6jtp" data-start="2065" data-end="2088">Personal essentials</li>\n</ul>\n	\N	\N	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	t	\N	\N	\N
dcaf8467-1c0c-4484-a0b5-973d62332baf	Annapurna Region Sightseeing Tour	annapurna-region-sightseeing-tour	{}	5 Days	All year (Spring &amp; Autumn best)	Nepal	Moderate		Kathmandu	Kathmandu	B.B.	<p data-start="214" data-end="582">The <strong data-start="218" data-end="255">Annapurna Region Sightseeing Tour</strong> is a perfect blend of natural beauty, cultural exploration, and Himalayan views without the need for long trekking. Centered around the beautiful city of <span><span>Pokhara</span></span>, this tour offers breathtaking panoramas of the Annapurna mountain range, peaceful lakes, traditional villages, and scenic viewpoints.</p>\n<p data-start="584" data-end="904">Travelers will explore iconic destinations such as <span><span>Sarangkot</span></span> for sunrise views, <span><span>Phewa Lake</span></span> for boating, and nearby cultural villages like Ghandruk. This tour is ideal for those seeking a relaxed Himalayan experience with light walking and comfortable accommodation.</p>	<ul>\n<li data-section-id="1jxxy32" data-start="927" data-end="998">Stunning views of Annapurna &amp; <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Machhapuchhre</span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id="15drflk" data-start="999" data-end="1064">Sunrise experience from <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Sarangkot</span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id="9mgnqk" data-start="1065" data-end="1117">Boating on <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Phewa Lake</span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id="i2f1gf" data-start="1118" data-end="1192">Visit traditional Gurung village <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Ghandruk</span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id="1oao2te" data-start="1193" data-end="1238">Explore waterfalls, caves &amp; local markets</li>\n<li data-section-id="nltmhx" data-start="1239" data-end="1282">Relaxing lakeside experience in Pokhara</li>\n<li data-section-id="15fa2go" data-start="1283" data-end="1328">Short and easy tour suitable for all ages</li>\n<li data-section-id="hlnk9v" data-start="1329" data-end="1362">Optional adventure activities</li>\n</ul>\n	[{"day": "1", "desc": "Arrive in Kathmandu where our representative will welcome you and transfer you to your hotel. After check-in, relax or explore the vibrant Thamel area. In the evening, attend a short briefing about your Annapurna Region Sightseeing Tour. This day allows you to prepare and get familiar with Nepal’s culture and environment before heading to Pokhara.\\";", "elev": 1400, "title": "Day 01: Arrival in Kathmandu (1,400 m)"}, {"day": "2", "desc": "Drive to Pokhara through scenic highways alongside rivers, hills, and local villages. Upon arrival, check into your hotel near Lakeside. In the evening, enjoy a relaxing walk along Phewa Lake and experience the peaceful environment.", "elev": 822, "title": "Day 02: Drive Kathmandu to Pokhara (822 m)"}, {"day": "3", "desc": "Explore major attractions including Davis Falls, Gupteshwor Cave, and boating at Phewa Lake. Enjoy stunning views of the Annapurna range and experience Pokhara’s natural beauty and cultural charm.\\";", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 03: Pokhara Sightseeing Tour"}, {"day": "4", "desc": "Early morning drive to Sarangkot to witness a breathtaking sunrise over Annapurna and Machhapuchhre. Later, drive to Ghandruk and explore the traditional Gurung village, its culture, and stunning mountain views before returning to Pokhara.", "elev": 2012, "title": "Day 04: Sarangkot Sunrise &amp; Ghandruk Village Visit (2,012 m)"}, {"day": "5", "desc": "Return to Kathmandu by flight or road. Enjoy scenic views during the journey. Upon arrival, transfer to the airport for your departure or extend your stay.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 05: Return to Kathmandu &amp; Departure"}]	<ul data-start="1685" data-end="1923">\n<li data-section-id="14iwjbm" data-start="1685" data-end="1714">Airport pickup &amp; drop-off</li>\n<li data-section-id="13nx4py" data-start="1715" data-end="1760">Hotel accommodation (Kathmandu &amp; Pokhara)</li>\n<li data-section-id="o6n35n" data-start="1761" data-end="1811">Transportation (tourist bus / private vehicle)</li>\n<li data-section-id="v05icb" data-start="1812" data-end="1841">Pokhara sightseeing tours</li>\n<li data-section-id="zur7v3" data-start="1842" data-end="1859">Guide service</li>\n<li data-section-id="3ddg1o" data-start="1860" data-end="1884">Breakfast (BB basis)</li>\n<li data-section-id="1b55flg" data-start="1885" data-end="1923">Government taxes &amp; service charges</li>\n</ul>\n	<ul data-start="1952" data-end="2151">\n<li data-section-id="sckugo" data-start="1952" data-end="1977">International airfare</li>\n<li data-section-id="116xcid" data-start="1978" data-end="1996">Nepal visa fee</li>\n<li data-section-id="1gecbsa" data-start="1997" data-end="2017">Travel insurance</li>\n<li data-section-id="1be9l0o" data-start="2018" data-end="2036">Lunch &amp; dinner</li>\n<li data-section-id="i12pz7" data-start="2037" data-end="2077">Personal expenses (shopping, drinks)</li>\n<li data-section-id="13evzu1" data-start="2078" data-end="2125">Adventure activities (paragliding, zipline)</li>\n<li data-section-id="50jr5y" data-start="2126" data-end="2151">Tips for guide/driver</li>\n</ul>\n	0	0	2026-08-23 02:08:08.019	2026-08-23 02:08:08.019	\N	<p data-start="214" data-end="582">The <strong data-start="218" data-end="255">Annapurna Region Sightseeing Tour</strong> is a perfect blend of natura	\N	\N	\N	https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Annapurna-Region-Sightseeing-Tour1-scaled.png	f	f	\N	\N	\N	<ul data-start="2194" data-end="2365">\n<li data-section-id="40v7fj" data-start="2194" data-end="2223">Comfortable walking shoes</li>\n<l