b7203f87-d687-416e-93f6-b769b3bc6424	Nepal Heritage, Wildlife & Himalayan Discovery Tour	nepal-heritage-wildlife-himalayan-discovery-tour	{}	9 days	March-Jun / Oct-Jan	Nepal	Moderate		Kathmandu	Kathmandu	B.B.	<strong>Overview</strong>\n\nExperience the best of Nepal in 8 days, exploring the cultural treasures of Kathmandu, the wildlife of Chitwan National Park, the spiritual birthplace of Lord Buddha in Lumbini, the scenic beauty of Pokhara, and the breathtaking Himalayan sunrise from Nagarkot. This journey offers a perfect blend of heritage, nature, wildlife, spirituality, and mountain landscapes.	<ul>\n<li data-section-id="tfuzas" data-start="24" data-end="74">Explore Kathmandu's UNESCO World Heritage Sites.</li>\n<li data-section-id="1f42fxy" data-start="75" data-end="146">Witness stunning Himalayan sunrise views from Sarangkot and Nagarkot.</li>\n<li data-section-id="1eluh3z" data-start="147" data-end="201">Enjoy a peaceful boat ride on Phewa Lake in Pokhara.</li>\n<li data-section-id="8ncwo9" data-start="202" data-end="263">Visit Davis Falls, Gupteshwor Cave, and Bindabasini Temple.</li>\n<li data-section-id="cf1nvy" data-start="264" data-end="313">Explore Lumbini, the birthplace of Lord Buddha.</li>\n<li data-section-id="1xfdib6" data-start="314" data-end="366">Experience a Jeep Safari in Chitwan National Park.</li>\n<li data-section-id="f3dp11" data-start="367" data-end="425">Enjoy canoe rides, bird watching, and jungle activities.</li>\n<li data-section-id="579r1m" data-start="426" data-end="479">Discover the unique culture of the Tharu community.</li>\n<li data-section-id="1w5kt51" data-start="480" data-end="555">Scenic drives through Nepal's beautiful hills, villages, and countryside.</li>\n<li data-section-id="1p9x5kv" data-start="556" data-end="635" data-is-last-node="">Perfect blend of culture, spirituality, wildlife, nature, and mountain views.</li>\n</ul>\n	[{"day": "1", "desc": "Arrive in Kathmandu, receive a warm welcome, transfer to your hotel, and enjoy a relaxing introduction to Nepal's vibrant culture and heritage.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 1: Arrival in Kathmandu"}, {"day": "2", "desc": "Explore Kathmandu’s rich cultural and spiritual heritage through its most iconic UNESCO World Heritage Sites and sacred landmarks.\\";", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 2: Kathmandu Heritage Sightseeing"}, {"day": "3", "desc": "Enjoy a scenic journey from Kathmandu to Pokhara, Nepal's beautiful lakeside city surrounded by stunning Himalayan landscapes.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 3: Kathmandu – Pokhara\\";"}, {"day": "4", "desc": "Discover the natural beauty, cultural landmarks, and breathtaking mountain views of Pokhara, Nepal's most scenic lakeside destination.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 4: Pokhara Sightseeing"}, {"day": "5", "desc": "Travel from the scenic lakeside city of Pokhara to Lumbini, the sacred birthplace of Lord Buddha and one of the world's most important pilgrimage destinations.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 5: Pokhara – Lumbini\\";"}, {"day": "6", "desc": "Travel from the sacred birthplace of Lord Buddha to the wildlife-rich plains of Chitwan and experience the cultural charm of Nepal's famous jungle region.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 6: Lumbini – Chitwan\\";"}, {"day": "7", "desc": "Enjoy an exciting wildlife adventure in Chitwan National Park before travelling to Nagarkot, a beautiful hill station renowned for its Himalayan views.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 7: Chitwan Jungle Activities – Nagarkot\\";"}, {"day": "8", "desc": "Enjoy a relaxing day in Nagarkot surrounded by breathtaking Himalayan scenery, peaceful hill landscapes, and fresh mountain air.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 8: Nagarkot Leisure &amp; Himalayan Views"}, {"day": "9", "desc": "Witness a spectacular Himalayan sunrise in Nagarkot before returning to Kathmandu for your onward departure.", "elev": 0, "title": "Day 9: Nagarkot – Kathmandu Departure\\";"}]	<ul>\n<li data-section-id="racx8x" data-start="25" data-end="67">Airport arrival and departure tra