vel insurance.</li>\n<li data-section-id="16h9fml" data-start="847" data-end="884">Lunch and dinner except in Chitwan.</li>\n<li data-section-id="1ljfk7s" data-start="885" data-end="940">Personal expenses (laundry, telephone, drinks, etc.).</li>\n<li data-section-id="1vaddnj" data-start="941" data-end="984">Optional activities and adventure sports.</li>\n<li data-section-id="1a5jdja" data-start="985" data-end="1033">Monument and entrance fees during sightseeing.</li>\n<li data-section-id="gkin9o" data-start="1034" data-end="1093">Tips and gratuities for guides, drivers, and hotel staff.</li>\n<li data-section-id="3hf8hx" data-start="1094" data-end="1201">Any expenses arising from flight delays, natural disasters, strikes, or circumstances beyond our control.</li>\n<li data-section-id="1jpb8id" data-start="1202" data-end="1269" data-is-last-node="">Any services not specifically mentioned under "Package Includes".</li>\n</ul>\n	1299	0	2026-08-23 02:08:08.019	2026-08-23 02:08:08.019	\N	<strong>Overview</strong>\n\nExperience the best of Nepal in 8 days, exploring the cultural treasures of Kathmandu, the wildlife of Chitwan National Par	\N	\N	\N	https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ChatGPT-Image-Jun-8-2026-01_38_50-PM.png	f	f	\N	\N	\N	<h2 data-section-id="1u13emr" data-start="0" data-end="25"><span role="text">🎒 <strong data-start="6" data-end="25">Essential Items</strong></span></h2>\n<ul data-start="26" data-end="145">\n<li data-section-id="fshj84" data-start="26" data-end="61">Valid Passport &amp; Travel Documents</li>\n<li data-section-id="1lal7di" data-start="62" data-end="90">Travel Insurance Documents</li>\n<li data-section-id="1nphj1d" data-start="91" data-end="120">Cash and Credit/Debit Cards</li>\n<li data-section-id="1d45cre" data-start="121" data-end="145">Mobile Phone &amp; Charger</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-section-id="1073cy9" data-start="147" data-end="165"><span role="text">👕 <strong data-start="153" data-end="165">Clothing</strong></span></h2>\n<ul data-start="166" data-end="329">\n<li data-section-id="1i0gf33" data-start="166" data-end="193">Comfortable Walking Shoes</li>\n<li data-section-id="1lxbvoo" data-start="194" data-end="230">Lightweight &amp; Comfortable Clothing</li>\n<li data-section-id="1sxk4kh" data-start="231" data-end="266">Warm Jacket/Fleece (for Nagarkot)</li>\n<li data-section-id="15w1gd2" data-start="267" data-end="303">Rain Jacket or Umbrella (seasonal)</li>\n<li data-section-id="1ac7xfe" data-start="304" data-end="316">Hat or Cap</li>\n<li data-section-id="11rfapo" data-start="317" data-end="329">Sunglasses</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-section-id="cphd50" data-start="331" data-end="360"><span role="text">🧴 <strong data-start="337" data-end="360">Personal Care Items</strong></span></h2>\n<ul data-start="361" data-end="471">\n<li data-section-id="10pl9xo" data-start="361" data-end="372">Sunscreen</li>\n<li data-section-id="1vpa9hb" data-start="373" data-end="383">Lip Balm</li>\n<li data-section-id="9g8hlf" data-start="384" data-end="402">Insect Repellent</li>\n<li data-section-id="b4dzxu" data-start="403" data-end="424">Personal Toiletries</li>\n<li data-section-id="788cf6" data-start="425" data-end="448">Reusable Water Bottle</li>\n<li data-section-id="zwksl4" data-start="449" data-end="471">Personal Medications</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-section-id="8vq7tq" data-start="473" data-end="508"><span role="text">📷 <strong data-start="479" data-end="508">Electronics &amp; Accessories</strong></span></h2>\n<ul data-start="509" data-end="590">\n<li data-section-id="1uxv8b5" data-start="509" data-end="517">Camera</li>\n<li data-section-id="k2pgd5" data-start="518" data-end="535">Extra Batteries</li>\n<li data-section-id="dl7h8x" data-start="536" data-end="548">Power Bank</li>\n<li data-section-id="1o14uha" data-start="549" data-end="563">Memory Cards</li>\n<li data-section-id="9xusyy" data-start="564" data-end="590">Universal Travel Adapter</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-section-id="ms940u" data-start="592" data-end="616"><span role="text">🎯 <strong data-start="598" data-end="616">Optional Items</strong></span></h2>\n<ul data-start="617" data-end="752">\n<li data-section-id="80h0hd" data-start="617" data-end="660">Binoculars (for Chitwan wildlife viewing)</li>\n<li data-section-id="1s2cbhu" data-start="661" data-end="676">Small Daypack</li>\n<li data-section-id="1kznx41" data-start="677" data-end="704">Trekking Poles (optional)</li>\n<li data-section-id="1cdzm7g" data-start="705" data-end="721">Notebook &amp; Pen</li>\n<li data-section-id="e22j4v" data-start="722" data-end="752">Light Snacks for Long Drives</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-section-id="alj5id" data-start="754" data-end="778"><span role="text">ℹ️ <strong data-start="760" data-end="778">Important Note</strong></span></h2>\n<p data-start="779" data-end="1009" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Pack light and comfortable clothing suitable for varying weather conditions, from the warm plains of Lumbini and Chitwan to the cooler hill station of Nagarkot. Comfortable walking shoes are highly recommended throughout the tour.</p>\n	\N	\N	{}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	t	\N	\N	\N
