-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);">\n<div data-processed="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);">\n\n<!--qkimaf pkfMC_31/HugV6-->\n<div data-ved="0CAAQkK0UahcKEwiYq6a4xLSWAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQdg" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);">\n<div data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);">\n<div data-ved="0CAEQp4QQahcKEwiYq6a4xLSWAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQdg" data-hveid="1" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);">\n<div data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 13.3333px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);">\n<div role="heading" aria-level="3" data-animation-nesting="" data-sfc-cp="" data-wiz-attrbind="aria-level=OCCYoe_2r/fLk2Md" data-sfc-root="ep" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);"><span data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-root="ep" data-complete="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);"><span data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-root="ep" data-complete="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);"><span data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-root="c" data-ved="2ahUKEwiU_8z3yrSWAxViyjgGHZ8-GKgQ0fERegYIAAgREAA" data-complete="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);">Upper Dolpo Trekking<!--TgQPHd|||[]--><!--TgQPHd|||[false,&quot;&quot;,false,{&quot;u&quot;:0}]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> – A Remote Himalayan Adventure<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\n<div data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-root="ep" data-hveid="CAAIEhAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);">The <strong data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-root="ep" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);">Upper Dolpo Trekking<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> experience stands out as one of Nepal's most remote, rewarding, and deeply spiritual wilderness adventures. Tucked away in the far-western Himalayas, this forbidden land offers an extraordinary landscape defined by stark barren valleys, deep river gorges, and the legendary emerald-blue waters of Phoksundo Lake. Unlike the busier trails of Nepal, this ancient pathway provides absolute peace, untouched alpine beauty, and a rare opportunity to witness an isolated mountain culture that has remained unchanged for centuries. It is the ultimate journey for intrepid travelers seeking true solitude in a pristine Himalayan sanctuary.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\n<div data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-root="ep" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\n<div role="heading" aria-level="3" data-animation-nesting="" data-sfc-cp="" data-wiz-attrbind="aria-level=OCCYoe_35/fLk2Md" data-sfc-root="ep" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);">Discover Hidden Valleys and Ancient Monasteries<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\n<div data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-root="ep" data-hveid="CAAIExAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);">This legendary trail leads adventurers through the high-altitude landscapes of Shey Phoksundo National Park. Along the way, you will witness spectacular scenery and cross challenging high mountain passes like Kang La and Saldang La. The route connects traditional, isolated villages where the local people practice the ancient, pre-Buddhist Bon religion. Exploring centuries-old monasteries like Shey Gompa adds an unforgettable spiritual depth to this rugged wilderness journey.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\n<div data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-root="ep" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\n<div role="heading" aria-level="3" data-animation-nesting="" data-sfc-cp="" data-wiz-attrbind="aria-level=OCCYoe_3d/fLk2Md" data-sfc-root="ep" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);">Why Choose this Isolated Wilderness Path?<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\n<div data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-root="ep" data-hveid="CAAIFBAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);">This epic route offers an unparalleled escape for experienced hikers seeking true isolation and deep cultural immersion. Not only does it showcase dramatic trans-Himalayan scenery, but it also provides a rare glimpse into a lifestyle untouched by the modern world. Furthermore, the pristine environment serves as a sanctuary for rare wildlife, including the elusive snow leopard and blue sheep. Ultimately, it delivers an extraordinary adventure that very few travelers ever get to experience.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\n<div data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-root="ep" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\n<div role="heading" aria-level="3" data-animation-nesting="" data-sfc-cp="" data-wiz-attrbind="aria-level=OCCYoe_3l/fLk2Md" data-sfc-root="ep" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);">Preparing for Your Wilderness Expedition<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\n<div data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-root="ep" data-hveid="CAAIFRAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);">Because this region is highly restricted and completely isolated, travelers must plan carefully before setting out. You will need a registered guide, a special restricted area permit, and fully self-sufficient camping equipment. The best time to visit is from May to October, as the area lies in the rain shadow of the Himalayas, making it an ideal summer trek.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\n<div data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-root="ep" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\n\n<hr data-sfc-root="ep" data-sfc-pl="|||[]" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 32px 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(128, 128, 128);" />\n\n<div data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-root="ep" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\n<div role="heading" aria-level="3" data-animation-nesting="" data-sfc-cp="" data-wiz-attrbind="aria-level=OCCYoe_3v/fLk2Md" data-sfc-root="ep" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sae="" aria-owns="action-menu-parent-container" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);"></div>\nThe <strong data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-root="ep" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);"><span data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-root="ep" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);"><span data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-root="ep" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);"><span data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-root="c" data-ved="2ahUKEwjz9OmcyrSWAxWMUGwGHZaRKdkQ0fERegYIAAgPEAE" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);">Upper Dolpo Trekking<!--TgQPHd|||[]--><!--TgQPHd|||[false,&quot;&quot;,false,{&quot;u&quot;:0}]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> experience stands out as one of Nepal's most remote, rewarding, and deeply spiritual wilderness adventures. Located in the far-western Himalayas, this hidden region offers a mesmerizing landscape of barren valleys, deep gorges, and crystal-clear lakes. Unlike busier trails, this ancient pathway provides absolute peace, untouched natural beauty, and a chance to witness an isolated mountain culture that has remained unchanged for centuries. It is the ultimate choice for trekkers seeking a true, off-the-beaten-path journey.\n\n</div>\n<div data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);"></div>\n<div data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--cqw1tb pkfMC_31/HugV6-->\n\n</div>\n<!--TgQPHdpkfMC_2p/ns9scf;pkfMC_2p/Qok6p|pkfMC_31/N7abZd||[[0,null,null,null,0,0,0,null,1],{&quot;s&quot;:null,&quot;i&quot;:&quot;pkfMC_2p/ns9scf&quot;},true,34,{&quot;s&quot;:true,&quot;i&quot;:&quot;pkfMC_2p/Qok6p&quot;}]-->\n\n</div>\n<div data-sfc-root="ep" data-wiz-uids="pkfMC_44,pkfMC_45,pkfMC_46" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);">\n<div data-processed="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);">\n<div data-sfc-cp="" data-sfc-root="ep" data-wiz-uids="pkfMC_48,pkfMC_49,pkfMC_4a" data-ved="2ahUKEwjR5_jPyLSWAxXwWnADHVTBLPYQkK0UegYIAAgWEBQ" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-copy-service-computed-style="font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240);"><button aria-label="Good response" aria-pressed="false" data-snt="40" 