ba58228b-e387-4b88-bcd6-79d03c81798b	blogs	Blogs			<h2>ARTICLES</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>OUR BLOGS</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Explore inspiring stories, travel experiences, and insights from the heart of the Himalayas.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a role="button">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRead More\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<a href="https://everpeakadventures.com/?p=12229"></a>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a role="button">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRead More\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<a href="https://everpeakadventures.com/?p=12225"></a>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a role="button">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRead More\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<a href="https://everpeakadventures.com/?p=12223"></a>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a role="button">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRead More\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<a href="https://everpeakadventures.com/?p=12221"></a>	2026-08-23 02:08:08.071	2026-08-23 02:08:08.071
f77be44c-f475-40f7-8b79-2a2b7d0fb95f	terms-and-conditions	Terms and Conditions		https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Annapurna-12-days-2.jpg	<p data-start="277" data-end="523">Welcome to <strong data-start="288" data-end="311">Ever Peak Adventure</strong>. By accessing our website, making an inquiry, or booking any of our services, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following Terms &amp; Conditions. Please read them carefully before confirming your booking.</p>\n\n<h2 data-start="530" data-end="558">1. Booking &amp; Confirmation</h2>\n<ul data-start="560" data-end="838">\n \t<li data-start="560" data-end="648">\n<p data-start="562" data-end="648">All bookings must be made through our website, email, or authorized representatives.</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="649" data-end="735">\n<p data-start="651" data-end="735">A booking is confirmed only after receipt of the required deposit or full payment.</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="736" data-end="838">\n<p data-start="738" data-end="838">Upon confirmation, clients will receive booking details, trip information, and payment confirmation.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-start="845" data-end="859">2. Payments</h2>\n<ul data-start="861" data-end="1185">\n \t<li data-start="861" data-end="1007">\n<p data-start="863" data-end="1007">A deposit is required to secure your booking. The remaining balance must be paid before trip commencement, unless otherwise agreed in writing.</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="1008" data-end="1081">\n<p data-start="1010" data-end="1081">All prices are quoted in USD (or equivalent) unless stated otherwise.</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="1082" data-end="1185">\n<p data-start="1084" data-end="1185">Any bank charges, transaction fees, or currency conversion fees are the responsibility of the client.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-start="1192" data-end="1226">3. Cancellation &amp; Refund Policy</h2>\n<ul data-start="1228" data-end="1610">\n \t<li data-start="1228" data-end="1283">\n<p data-start="1230" data-end="1283">Cancellation requests must be submitted in writing.</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="1284" data-end="1418">\n<p data-start="1286" data-end="1418">Refund amounts depend on the timing of cancellation and services already arranged (permits, accommodations, transportation, etc.).</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="1419" data-end="1513">\n<p data-start="1421" data-end="1513">Certain costs such as permits, flight tickets, and government fees are <strong data-start="1492" data-end="1510">non-refundable</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="1514" data-end="1610">\n<p data-start="1516" data-end="1610">No refunds will be issued for unused services, early departure, or voluntary trip termination.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-start="1617" data-end="1659">4. Trip Changes &amp; Itinerary Adjustments</h2>\n<ul data-start="1661" data-end="2005">\n \t<li data-start="1661" data-end="1845">\n<p data-start="1663" data-end="1845">Ever Peak Adventure reserves the right to modify itineraries due to weather conditions, safety concerns, political situations, natural disasters, or other unforeseen circumstances.</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="1846" data-end="1928">\n<p data-start="1848" data-end="1928">Changes are made in the best interest of client safety and overall experience.</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="1929" data-end="2005">\n<p data-start="1931" data-end="2005">No compensation will be provided for itinerary changes beyond our control.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-start="2012" data-end="2041">5. Client Responsibilities</h2>\n<ul data-start="2043" data-end="2420">\n \t<li data-start="2043" data-end="2126">\n<p data-start="2045" data-end="2126">Clients must ensure they are physically and mentally fit for their chosen trip.</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="2127" data-end="2222">\n<p data-start="2129" data-end="2222">Accurate personal, medical, and travel information must be provided at the time of booking.</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="2223" data-end="2333">\n<p data-start="2225" data-end="2333">Clients are responsible for obtaining valid passports, visas, travel insurance, and required vaccinations.</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="2334" data-end="2420">\n<p data-start="2336" data-end="2420">Respect for local culture, customs, laws, and environmental guidelines is mandatory.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-start="2427" data-end="2449">6. Travel Insurance</h2>\n<ul data-start="2451" data-end="2714">\n \t<li data-start="2451" data-end="2614">\n<p data-start="2453" data-end="2614">Comprehensive travel insurance covering medical emergencies, evacuation, trip cancellation, and high-altitude activities is <strong data-start="2577" data-end="2590">mandatory</strong> for all participants.</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="2615" data-end="2714">\n<p data-start="2617" data-end="2714">Ever Peak Adventure is not responsible for any losses arising from inadequate insurance coverage.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-start="2721" data-end="2764">7. Health, Safety &amp; Risk Acknowledgement</h2>\n<ul data-start="2766" data-end="3071">\n \t<li data-start="2766" data-end="2894">\n<p data-start="2768" data-end="2894">Adventure travel involves inherent risks including injury, illness, altitude sickness, weather changes, and natural hazards.</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="2895" data-end="2979">\n<p data-start="2897" data-end="2979">By booking with Ever Peak Adventure, clients acknowledge and accept these risks.</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="2980" data-end="3071">\n<p data-start="2982" data-end="3071">Clients agree to follow the guidance of guides and staff at all times for safety reasons.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-start="3078" data-end="3105">8. Use of Images &amp; Media</h2>\n<ul data-start="3107" data-end="3305">\n \t<li data-start="3107" data-end="3205">\n<p data-start="3109" data-end="3205">Ever Peak Adventure may use photographs or videos taken during trips for promotional purposes.</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="3206" data-end="3305">\n<p data-start="3208" data-end="3305">If you do not wish your images to be used, please inform us in writing before or during the trip.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-start="3312" data-end="3338">9. Liability Disclaimer</h2>\n<ul data-start="3340" data-end="3623">\n \t<li data-start="3340" data-end="3551">\n<p data-start="3342" data-end="3551">Ever Peak Adventure is not liable for delays, injuries, loss, damage, or expenses caused by events beyond our control, including but not limited to weather, natural disasters, strikes, or government actions.</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="3552" data-end="3623">\n<p data-start="3554" data-end="3623">Our liability is limited to the value of the services booked with us.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-start="3630" data-end="3657">10. Third-Party Services</h2>\n<ul data-start="3659" data-end="3844">\n \t<li data-start="3659" data-end="3747">\n<p data-start="3661" data-end="3747">We work with trusted local partners for accommodations, transportation, and flights.</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="3748" data-end="3844">\n<p data-start="3750" data-end="3844">Ever Peak Adventure is not responsible for acts or omissions of third-party service providers.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-start="3851" data-end="3886">11. Governing Law &amp; Jurisdiction</h2>\n<ul data-start="3888" data-end="4021">\n \t<li data-start="3888" data-end="3951">\n<p data-start="3890" data-end="3951">These Terms &amp; Conditions are governed by the laws of Nepal.</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="3952" data-end="4021">\n<p data-start="3954" data-end="4021">Any disputes shall be subject to the jurisdiction of Nepali courts.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-start="4028" data-end="4064">12. Changes to Terms &amp; Conditions</h2>\n<ul data-start="4066" data-end="4239">\n \t<li data-start="4066" data-end="4166">\n<p data-start="4068" data-end="4166">Ever Peak Adventure reserves the right to update or modify these Terms &amp; Conditions at any time.</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="4167" data-end="4239">\n<p data-start="4169" data-end="4239">Updates will be effective immediately upon publication on our website.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-start="4246" data-end="4272">13. Contact Information</h2>\n<p data-start="4274" data-end="4339">For questions regarding these Terms &amp; Conditions, please contact:</p>\n<p data-start="4341" data-end="4414"><strong data-start="4341" data-end="4364">Ever Peak Adventure</strong><br data-start="4364" data-end="4367" />📧 Email: <a href="mailto:info@everpeakadventures.com"><span>info@everpeakadventures.com</span></a><br data-start="4391" data-end="4394" />📍 Location: Nepal</p>	2026-08-23 02:08:08.071	2026-08-23 02:08:08.071
82ff7623-8094-4705-8324-4d350eb71b87	privacy-policy	Privacy Policy		https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/himal.jpg	<p data-start="230" data-end="478"><strong data-start="230" data-end="253">Ever Peak Adventure</strong> values your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and safeguard your data when you visit our website, make inquiries, or book our services.</p>\n<p data-start="480" data-end="567">By using our website and services, you agree to the practices described in this policy.</p>\n\n<h2 data-start="574" data-end="602">1. Information We Collect</h2>\n<p data-start="604" data-end="654">We may collect the following types of information:</p>\n\n<ul data-start="656" data-end="1204">\n \t<li data-start="656" data-end="834">\n<p data-start="658" data-end="834"><strong data-start="658" data-end="682">Personal Information</strong>: Name, email address, phone number, nationality, passport details (when required for permits), and other details provided during inquiries or bookings.</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="835" data-end="941">\n<p data-start="837" data-end="941"><strong data-start="837" data-end="869">Booking &amp; Travel Information</strong>: Trip preferences, emergency contact details, and special requirements.</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="942" data-end="1089">\n<p data-start="944" data-end="1089"><strong data-start="944" data-end="967">Payment Information</strong>: Limited payment-related details processed securely through trusted payment gateways (we do not store full card details).</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="1090" data-end="1204">\n<p data-start="1092" data-end="1204"><strong data-start="1092" data-end="1117">Technical Information</strong>: IP address, browser type, device information, and website usage data through cookies.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-start="1211" data-end="1244">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>\n<p data-start="1246" data-end="1274">Your information is used to:</p>\n\n<ul data-start="1276" data-end="1550">\n \t<li data-start="1276" data-end="1331">\n<p data-start="1278" data-end="1331">Respond to inquiries and provide requested services</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="1332" data-end="1386">\n<p data-start="1334" data-end="1386">Process bookings, permits, and travel arrangements</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="1387" data-end="1441">\n<p data-start="1389" data-end="1441">Communicate important trip updates and information</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="1442" data-end="1500">\n<p data-start="1444" data-end="1500">Improve our website, services, and customer experience</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="1501" data-end="1550">\n<p data-start="1503" data-end="1550">Comply with legal and regulatory requirements</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start="1552" data-end="1625">We only collect information that is necessary for providing our services.</p>\n\n<h2 data-start="1632" data-end="1670">3. Information Sharing &amp; Disclosure</h2>\n<p data-start="1672" data-end="1752">Ever Peak Adventure <strong data-start="1692" data-end="1725">does not sell, rent, or trade</strong> your personal information.</p>\n<p data-start="1754" data-end="1794">We may share your information only with:</p>\n\n<ul data-start="1795" data-end="2031">\n \t<li data-start="1795" data-end="1863">\n<p data-start="1797" data-end="1863">Government authorities (for permits, visas, or legal requirements)</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="1864" data-end="1986">\n<p data-start="1866" data-end="1986">Trusted partners such as guides, hotels, transport providers, or insurance companies (only when necessary for your trip)</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="1987" data-end="2031">\n<p data-start="1989" data-end="2031">Payment processors for secure transactions</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start="2033" data-end="2124">All third parties are required to protect your data and use it solely for service delivery.</p>\n\n<h2 data-start="2131" data-end="2150">4. Data Security</h2>\n<p data-start="2152" data-end="2412">We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, misuse, loss, or disclosure. While no online system is completely secure, we continuously work to maintain strong data protection standards.</p>\n\n<h2 data-start="2419" data-end="2456">5. Cookies &amp; Tracking Technologies</h2>\n<p data-start="2458" data-end="2489">Our website may use cookies to:</p>\n\n<ul data-start="2490" data-end="2585">\n \t<li data-start="2490" data-end="2515">\n<p data-start="2492" data-end="2515">Enhance user experience</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="2516" data-end="2557">\n<p data-start="2518" data-end="2557">Analyze website traffic and performance</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="2558" data-end="2585">\n<p data-start="2560" data-end="2585">Remember user preferences</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start="2587" data-end="2698">You can control or disable cookies through your browser settings, though this may affect some website features.</p>\n\n<h2 data-start="2705" data-end="2722">6. Your Rights</h2>\n<p data-start="2724" data-end="2746">You have the right to:</p>\n\n<ul data-start="2747" data-end="2960">\n \t<li data-start="2747" data-end="2774">\n<p data-start="2749" data-end="2774">Access your personal data</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="2775" data-end="2821">\n<p data-start="2777" data-end="2821">Request correction of inaccurate information</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="2822" data-end="2900">\n<p data-start="2824" data-end="2900">Request deletion of your data (subject to legal or operational requirements)</p>\n</li>\n \t<li data-start="2901" data-end="2960">\n<p data-start="2903" data-end="2960">Withdraw consent for marketing communications at any time</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start="2962" data-end="3015">To exercise these rights, please contact us directly.</p>\n\n<h2 data-start="3022" data-end="3042">7. External Links</h2>\n<p data-start="3044" data-end="3257">Our website may contain links to third-party websites. Ever Peak Adventure is not responsible for the privacy practices or content of external sites. We encourage users to review their privacy policies separately.</p>\n\n<h2 data-start="3264" data-end="3300">8. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>\n<p data-start="3302" data-end="3456">We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in laws or services. Any updates will be posted on this page with immediate effect.</p>\n\n<h2 data-start="3463" data-end="3479">9. Contact Us</h2>\n<p data-start="3481" data-end="3595">If you have any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy or how we handle your data, please contact us:</p>\n<p data-start="3597" data-end="3670"><strong data-start="3597" data-end="3620">Ever Peak Adventure</strong><br data-start="3620" data-end="3623" />📧 Email: <a href="mailto:info@everpeakadventures.com"><span>info@everpeakadventures.com</span></a><br data-start="3647" data-end="3650" />📍 Location: Nepal</p>	2026-08-23 02:08:08.071	2026-08-23 02:08:08.071
00c2e6b8-5d3a-4573-a4c7-794789234552	become-our-business-partner	Become Our Business Partner		https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Hima1.jpg	<h2>Explore Tour</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>BUSINESS INQUIRY</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Discover carefully crafted trekking, climbing, and cultural tour packages across Nepal’s most iconic and hidden destinations.</p>	2026-08-23 02:08:08.071	2026-08-23 02:08:08.071
7d2383b7-e80a-48d7-b386-5b30f78e6fd8	why-ever-peak-adventures	Why Ever Peak Adventures			<p data-start="266" data-end="459"><strong data-start="266" data-end="293">Local Himalayan Experts</strong><br data-start="293" data-end="296" />Founded and operated by experienced Nepali mountaineers and travel professionals, we bring deep local knowledge and firsthand mountain experience to every journey.</p>\n<p data-start="461" data-end="672"><strong data-start="461" data-end="490">Safety Without Compromise</strong><br data-start="490" data-end="493" />Your safety is our highest priority. We follow strict safety standards, provide professional guidance, proper acclimatization, and well-planned itineraries for a secure adventure.</p>\n<p data-start="674" data-end="880"><strong data-start="674" data-end="704">Licensed &amp; Trusted Company</strong><br data-start="704" data-end="707" />Fully licensed by the Ministry of Tourism, Government of Nepal, and proud members of TAAN and NMA, we operate with transparency, professionalism, and ethical responsibility.</p>\n<p data-start="882" data-end="1042"><strong data-start="882" data-end="909">Personalized Adventures</strong><br data-start="909" data-end="912" />Every traveler is unique. We design tailor-made itineraries to match your interests, schedule, fitness level, and adventure goals.</p>\n<p data-start="1044" data-end="1232"><strong data-start="1044" data-end="1088">Experienced Guides &amp; Strong Support Team</strong><br data-start="1088" data-end="1091" />Our certified guides and support staff have more than a decade of hands-on experience leading treks and climbs across Nepal’s iconic regions.</p>\n<p data-start="1234" data-end="1393"><strong data-start="1234" data-end="1268">Authentic Cultural Experiences</strong><br data-start="1268" data-end="1271" />Go beyond the trails. We connect you with local communities, traditions, and lifestyles for a deeper Himalayan experience.</p>\n<p data-start="1395" data-end="1560"><strong data-start="1395" data-end="1432">Responsible &amp; Sustainable Tourism</strong><br data-start="1432" data-end="1435" />We support local livelihoods, respect cultural heritage, and promote eco-friendly practices to protect the mountains we love.</p>\n<p data-start="1562" data-end="1722"><strong data-start="1562" data-end="1602">Honest Service &amp; Transparent Pricing</strong><br data-start="1602" data-end="1605" />No hidden costs, no false promises—just clear communication, fair pricing, and reliable service from start to finish.</p>	2026-08-23 02:08:08.071	2026-08-23 02:08:08.071
8283e229-250b-4915-b864-f508abb9cf08	responsible-travel	Responsible Travel			<!-- Responsive Travel (Ever Peak Adventures) – Elementor HTML Widget -->\n\n<section>\n    <header>\n          <h2>Responsive Travel</h2>\n          Adventure with responsibility — for people, culture, and nature.\n        Explore Higher. Feel Deeper\n    </header>\n        <p>\n          At Ever Peak Adventure, we believe that adventure and responsibility go hand in hand. Exploring the Himalayas is a privilege,\n          and it comes with a duty to protect the natural environment, respect local communities, and preserve Nepal’s cultural heritage.\n          Every journey we plan is designed with sustainability in mind, so your adventure leaves a positive impact on the places you visit.\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          We are committed to sustainable trekking and travel practices. Our itineraries are carefully crafted to minimize environmental impact,\n          reduce waste, and protect fragile ecosystems. We encourage travelers to follow “Leave No Trace” principles, avoid single-use plastics,\n          and respect wildlife habitats. By working with local accommodations, guides, and service providers, we ensure your travel supports\n          the economic and social well-being of communities along the trails.\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          Cultural respect is at the heart of every journey we organize. Our guides help travelers understand local customs, traditions, and ethical behavior,\n          creating opportunities for meaningful interaction with local communities. From visiting remote villages to experiencing local festivals,\n          we aim to make your journey not only adventurous, but also enriching and respectful.\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          Safety and education go hand in hand with responsibility. Our team prepares travelers with high-altitude awareness, waste management guidance,\n          and ethical trekking practices, so every participant becomes a responsible traveler. By promoting awareness and mindfulness,\n          we inspire choices that benefit both people and the planet.\n        </p>\n          <p>\n            By choosing Ever Peak Adventure, you are not just exploring Nepal — you are joining a movement of responsible travelers who care for the environment,\n            uplift local communities, and honor the traditions of the Himalayas. Together, we can ensure these breathtaking landscapes and vibrant cultures\n            thrive for generations to come.\n          </p>\n      <aside>\n        <h3>Our Responsible Commitments</h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li>\n            ✓\n              <b>Leave No Trace</b>\n              Reduce waste, avoid single-use plastics, and keep trails clean.\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            ✓\n              <b>Support Local Communities</b>\n              Work with local guides, porters, and businesses to strengthen local livelihoods.\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            ✓\n              <b>Respect Culture & Traditions</b>\n              Learn local customs and behave ethically during village and monastery visits.\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            ✓\n              <b>Safety & Education</b>\n              High-altitude awareness, responsible trekking guidance, and mindful travel.\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      </aside>\n    <footer>\n      <small>Ever Peak Adventure • Responsible Trekking & Travel</small>\n      <a href="javascript:void(0)" aria-label="Responsible Travel">\n        Responsible Travel Promise\n      </a>\n    </footer>\n</section>	2026-08-23 02:08:08.071	2026-08-23 02:08:08.071
34f96753-7621-4668-b4e7-91f628427709	message-from-managing-director	Message From Founder			<section>\n<header>\n<h2>Message From Founder</h2>\nExplore Higher. Feel Deeper.\nEstb • 2024\n</header>\n<aside>\n<img src="https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/dipesh-Aryal-e1770639736472.jpeg"\nalt="Dipesh Aryal">\n<p>\nDipesh Aryal\n</p>\n<p>\nFounder • Ever Peak Adventures\n</p>\n</aside>\n<article>\n<p>\nWelcome to Ever Peak Adventures. I'm Dipesh Aryal, and trekking has been my life's work for the past 15 years. My journey in the Himalayas began from the ground level as a porter, later becoming a trekking guide, and eventually establishing Ever Peak Adventures to share authentic Himalayan experiences with travelers from around the world.\n</p>\n<p>\nHaving explored almost every trekking region of Nepal, I understand the mountains beyond the maps. From planning safe routes and logistics to creating memorable experiences, every journey is built on real field knowledge. Before founding this company, I had already helped more than <strong>10,000 travelers</strong> discover the beauty of Nepal.\n</p>\n⭐ 15+ Years Experience\n🏔️ Nepal Himalayan Expert\n🥾 Porter → Guide → Founder\n😊 10,000+ Happy Travelers\n<p>\nEver Peak Adventures was founded in 2024 with a simple vision—to provide honest service, professional guidance, and unforgettable Himalayan adventures. Every trip we organize reflects our commitment to safety, responsible tourism, and personalized hospitality.\n</p>\n<p>\nWhen you choose Ever Peak Adventures, you become part of our family. We promise clear communication, genuine care, and support from your very first inquiry until your safe return home.\n</p>\n<p>\nThank you for placing your trust in Ever Peak Adventures. I look forward to welcoming you to Nepal and helping you experience the Himalayas in the safest, most meaningful, and unforgettable way possible.\n</p>\n</article>\n<footer>\n<strong>Dipesh Aryal</strong>\nFounder, Ever Peak Adventures\n<a href="mailto:dipesh@everpeakadventure.com">\n<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">\n<path d="M4 7h16v10H4V7z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/>\n<path d="M4 7l8 6 8-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/>\n</svg>\ndipesh@everpeakadventure.com\n</a>\n</footer>\n</section>	2026-08-23 02:08:08.071	2026-08-23 02:08:08.071
41810a07-163d-48ca-a915-5fc037a6092b	about-us	About Us			<h3>About Ever Peak Adventures</h3>\n+\n+\n+\n+\n<h2>Our Mission</h2>\n<img src="https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/mission-1-2.png" sizes="(max-width: 459px) 100vw, 459px" srcset="https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/mission-1-2.png 459w, https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/mission-1-2-300x298.png 300w, https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/mission-1-2-150x150.png 150w" alt="" width="459" height="456" />\n<h2>Our Vision</h2>\n<img src="https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/vission-1-1.png" sizes="(max-width: 524px) 100vw, 524px" srcset="https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/vission-1-1.png 524w, https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/vission-1-1-298x300.png 298w, https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/vission-1-1-150x150.png 150w" alt="" width="524" height="527" />\n<h2>Our Goals</h2>\n<img src="https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/goal-1-2.png" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px" srcset="https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/goal-1-2.png 640w, https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/goal-1-2-300x283.png 300w" alt="" width="640" height="603" />\n<h2>Why Choose Us?</h2>\n<details open=""><summary tabindex="0" data-accordion-index="1" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-9180">Local Expertise, Global Standards</summary>\n<p data-start="234" data-end="491">Based in Nepal, we offer deep local knowledge combined with international service standards. Our experienced guides understand the mountains, culture, and terrain, ensuring a safe, authentic, and well-managed journey.</p>\n<p data-start="493" data-end="732"></p>\n\n</details><details><summary tabindex="-1" data-accordion-index="2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-9181">Licensed, Trusted, and Responsible</summary>\n<p data-start="493" data-end="732">We are officially licensed by the Ministry of Tourism, Government of Nepal, and are proud members of TAAN and NMA. This guarantees legal operation, safety compliance, and ethical trekking practices.</p>\n<p data-start="734" data-end="954"></p>\n\n</details><details><summary tabindex="-1" data-accordion-index="3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-9182">Experienced &amp; Professional Team</summary>\n<p data-start="734" data-end="954">With over a decade of experience, our guides, leaders, and support staff are highly trained in mountain safety, altitude awareness, and first aid—giving you confidence at every step.</p>\n<p data-start="956" data-end="1133"></p>\n\n</details><details><summary tabindex="-1" data-accordion-index="4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-9183">Customized Adventures</summary>\n<p data-start="956" data-end="1133">We don’t believe in one-size-fits-all itineraries. Every trip is carefully tailored to your interests, timeframe, fitness level, and adventure goals.</p>\n<p data-start="1135" data-end="1314"></p>\n\n</details><details><summary tabindex="-1" data-accordion-index="5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-9184">Safety First Approach</summary>\n<p data-start="1135" data-end="1314">Your safety is our top priority. We use well-planned routes, quality equipment, emergency protocols, and continuous monitoring throughout your journey.</p>\n<p data-start="1316" data-end="1468"></p>\n\n</details><details><summary tabindex="-1" data-accordion-index="6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-9185">Honest Pricing &amp; No Hidden Costs</summary>\n<p data-start="1316" data-end="1468">We offer transparent pricing with clear inclusions. What you see is what you get—no surprises, no hidden charges.</p>\n<p data-start="1470" data-end="1640"></p>\n\n</details><details><summary tabindex="-1" data-accordion-index="7" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-9186">Passion That Makes the Difference</summary>\n<p data-start="1642" data-end="1823">We genuinely love what we do. Every trek, tour, and climb is handled with care, dedication, and pride—because your journey is our reputation.</p>\n<p data-start="1825" data-end="2006"></p>\n\n</details>\n<p data-start="234" data-end="491">Based in Nepal, we offer deep local knowledge combined with international service standards. Our experienced guides understand the mountains, culture, and terrain, ensuring a safe, authentic, and well-managed journey.</p>\n<p data-start="493" data-end="732">We are officially licensed by the Ministry of Tourism, Government of Nepal, and are proud members of TAAN and NMA. This guarantees legal operation, safety compliance, and ethical trekking practices.</p>\n<p data-start="734" data-end="954">With over a decade of experience, our guides, leaders, and support staff are highly trained in mountain safety, altitude awareness, and first aid—giving you confidence at every step.</p>\n<p data-start="956" data-end="1133">We don’t believe in one-size-fits-all itineraries. Every trip is carefully tailored to your interests, timeframe, fitness level, and adventure goals.</p>\n<p data-start="1135" data-end="1314">Your safety is our top priority. We use well-planned routes, quality equipment, emergency protocols, and continuous monitoring throughout your journey.</p>\n<p data-start="1316" data-end="1468">We offer transparent pricing with clear inclusions. What you see is what you get—no surprises, no hidden charges.</p>\n<p data-start="1642" data-end="1823">We genuinely love what we do. Every trek, tour, and climb is handled with care, dedication, and pride—because your journey is our reputation.</p>\n<p data-start="1825" data-end="2006"></p>	2026-08-23 02:08:08.071	2026-08-23 02:08:08.071
