c5de63e5-dbd1-4dec-8e5b-111a27ad6804	test-page	test page			<h2>about connexica.</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Building the Future</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>with</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Artificial</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Intelligence</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>&amp; Big Data</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Connexica Technologies Pvt Ltd is a premier technology partner specializing in artificial intelligence and big data processing systems. Based in Kathmandu, Nepal, we combine advanced machine learning pipelines with cloud-native architectures to help enterprises scale faster, automate smarter, and make data-driven decisions with confidence.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEnterprise Scaling\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tIngest, transform and securely process petabytes of enterprise data using resilient cloud-native infrastructure.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEnterprise Scaling\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tIngest, transform and securely process petabytes of enterprise data using resilient cloud-native infrastructure.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCognitive AI\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAdvanced predictive analytics powered by deep learning and intelligent automation.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBig Data\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tHigh-performance processing pipelines designed for modern enterprise workloads.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\tProjects\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t0\n\t\t\t\t+\n\t\t\tEnterprise Clients\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t0\n\t\t\t\t+\n\t\t\tSystem Reliability\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t0\n\t\t\t\t%\n\t\t\tSupport\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t24\n\t\t\t\tHour\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>OUR PURPOSE\n</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Driven by Innovation,\nFocused on Your Growth</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Everything we build is designed to help organizations unlock the full potential of Artificial Intelligence, Big Data, and Cloud Technologies.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>01</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tOur Mission\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tEmpower businesses with intelligent digital solutions that transform complex data into strategic decisions through scalable AI and cloud-native technologies.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>02</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tOur Vision\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTo become a globally recognized technology company delivering intelligent platforms that redefine enterprise innovation and digital transformation.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>03</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tOur Goal\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBuild reliable AI ecosystems that increase efficiency, automate operations, strengthen security, and accelerate business growth.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>what we do</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>We Build</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Next-</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Generation</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Digital</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Intelligence</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Connexica Technologies develops intelligent software, enterprise-grade data infrastructure, and AI-powered automation that help organizations modernize operations and make faster business decisions.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBig Data Engineering\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tReal-time processing, ETL pipelines, Data Warehousing and Lakehouse.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCloud Infrastructure\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tScalable AWS, Azure and Google Cloud deployment with DevOps.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tArtificial Intelligence Solutions\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tMachine Learning, NLP, Computer Vision and Predictive Analytics.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBusiness Intelligence\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tInteractive dashboards, enterprise reporting and intelligent insights.\t\t\t\t\t</p>	2026-08-23 02:08:08.071	2026-08-23 02:08:08.071
