a6d39ecc-3750-42f2-aa64-7b67a8a3b422	Er Prakash Aryal	IT Manager	https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Er-Prakash-Aryal-Everpeak-Adventure.png	<h1 data-section-id="1h0v6kt" data-start="372" data-end="428">Er Prakash Aryal – IT Consultant at Everpeak Adventure</h1>\n<h2 data-section-id="z13lm2" data-start="430" data-end="455">About Er Prakash Aryal</h2>\n<p data-start="457" data-end="732"><strong data-start="457" data-end="477">Er Prakash Aryal</strong> is the IT Consultant at Everpeak Adventure. He is responsible for managing the company's digital systems and technology solutions. His expertise helps ensure that the website, online services, and communication platforms operate efficiently and securely.</p>\n\n<h2 data-section-id="1gxhzlx" data-start="734" data-end="762">Technology and Innovation</h2>\n<p data-start="764" data-end="1060">Prakash works closely with the management team to improve the company's digital presence. He oversees website performance, technical maintenance, and online security. In addition, he supports the implementation of new technologies that enhance customer experience and streamline daily operations.</p>\n<p data-start="1062" data-end="1263">Moreover, he continuously monitors system performance to ensure reliability. His problem-solving skills help the company respond quickly to technical challenges and maintain smooth business operations.</p>\n\n<h2 data-section-id="1jgacgt" data-start="1265" data-end="1294">Supporting Business Growth</h2>\n<p data-start="1296" data-end="1606">As an IT Consultant, Prakash contributes to the long-term growth of Everpeak Adventure. He develops practical digital solutions that improve efficiency and strengthen the company's online presence. Furthermore, he helps optimize technology to support marketing, customer communication, and business management.</p>\n\n<h2 data-section-id="yjvqh7" data-start="1608" data-end="1635">Commitment to Excellence</h2>\n<p data-start="1637" data-end="1955">Prakash believes that technology should simplify travel planning and improve customer satisfaction. Therefore, he focuses on delivering reliable, secure, and user-friendly digital services. His dedication allows Everpeak Adventure to provide a seamless experience for travelers before, during, and after their journey.</p>\n\n<h2 data-section-id="13dcvnv" data-start="1957" data-end="1973">Looking Ahead</h2>\n<p data-start="1975" data-end="2199">Today, <strong data-start="1982" data-end="2002">Er Prakash Aryal</strong> continues to support Everpeak Adventure through innovation and technology. His commitment to excellence helps the company grow while providing dependable digital solutions for travelers worldwide.</p>\n\n\n<hr data-start="2201" data-end="2204" />\n\n<h3 data-section-id="5425p4" data-start="2206" data-end="2219">Image SEO</h3>	0	2026-08-23 02:08:08.063	2026-08-23 02:08:08.063	t
d9071197-4c4d-48d2-bd7e-3d316fb7c41a	Sangita Aryal	 Accountant / Director	https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Sangita-Aryal-Everpeak-Adventures-nepal.png	<h3 data-w-component="title" data-w-weight="semibold" data-w-size="xl">Sangita Aryal – Co-Founder of Everpeak Adventure</h3>\n<h3 data-w-component="title" data-w-weight="semibold" data-w-size="lg">About Sangita Aryal</h3>\n<p data-w-component="text" data-w-wrap="normal"><span data-w-component="bold" data-w-default-strong="" data-w-inline="" data-w-wrap="normal">Sangita Aryal</span> is the Co-Founder of Everpeak Adventure, a leading trekking and tour company based in Nepal. She plays a vital role in the company's growth, customer relations, and overall management. Since the beginning of Everpeak Adventure, she has focused on creating a welcoming and professional experience for every traveler.</p>\n<p data-w-component="text" data-w-wrap="normal">Growing up in Nepal, Sangita developed a strong connection with the country's mountains, culture, and hospitality. Therefore, she understands what international visitors expect when they travel to the Himalayas. Her warm personality and attention to detail help guests feel comfortable from the moment they arrive in Nepal.</p>\n\n<h3 data-w-component="title" data-w-weight="semibold" data-w-size="lg">Leadership and Management</h3>\n<p data-w-component="text" data-w-wrap="normal">As a co-founder, Sangita works closely with the management team to ensure smooth daily operations. She coordinates travel arrangements, responds to customer inquiries, and helps maintain the high service standards of Everpeak Adventure. In addition, she carefully reviews feedback from travelers to improve the overall experience.</p>\n<p data-w-component="text" data-w-wrap="normal">Moreover, Sangita believes that excellent communication is essential for successful adventure travel. For this reason, she provides clear information about itineraries, accommodations, permits, transportation, and trekking preparations. Her organized approach helps travelers plan their trips with confidence.</p>\n\n<h3 data-w-component="title" data-w-weight="semibold" data-w-size="lg">Commitment to Customer Experience</h3>\n<p data-w-component="text" data-w-wrap="normal">Sangita is deeply committed to customer satisfaction. She understands that every traveler has different interests, fitness levels, and expectations. Therefore, she helps design personalized trekking and tour experiences that match each guest's needs.</p>\n<p data-w-component="text" data-w-wrap="normal">Furthermore, she ensures that travelers receive prompt support before, during, and after their journey. Whether guests are trekking to Everest Base Camp, Annapurna Base Camp, Langtang Valley, or exploring Nepal's cultural destinations, Sangita works to make every trip comfortable and memorable.</p>\n\n<h3 data-w-component="title" data-w-weight="semibold" data-w-size="lg">Supporting Responsible Tourism</h3>\n<p data-w-component="text" data-w-wrap="normal">Sangita strongly supports responsible tourism and community-based travel. She believes that tourism should create positive benefits for local people while protecting Nepal's natural environment. Consequently, Everpeak Adventure works with local guides, porters, hotels, and community businesses whenever possible.</p>\n<p data-w-component="text" data-w-wrap="normal">In addition, the company encourages respectful cultural interactions and environmentally friendly travel practices. This approach allows travelers to enjoy authentic experiences while contributing to local communities.</p>\n\n<h3 data-w-component="title" data-w-weight="semibold" data-w-size="lg">Looking Ahead</h3>\n<p data-w-component="text" data-w-wrap="normal">Today, <span data-w-component="bold" data-w-default-strong="" data-w-inline="" data-w-wrap="normal">Sangita Aryal</span> continues to lead Everpeak Adventure with dedication, professionalism, and genuine care for travelers. Her goal is to provide exceptional service, build lasting relationships with guests, and share the beauty of Nepal with visitors from around the world. Finally, her passion for hospitality and adventure remains a key part of Everpeak Adventure's success.</p>	0	2026-08-23 02:08:08.063	2026-08-23 02:08:08.063	t
5df44d15-f45a-42ff-9f2e-99417f2fba50	Dipesh Aryal	Leader / Founder	https://everpeakadventures.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Dipesh-Aryal-Ever-peak-Adventure.png	<h1 data-section-id="16ig8ji" data-start="301" data-end="367">Dipesh Aryal – Founder &amp; Managing Director of Everpeak Adventure</h1>\n<h2 data-section-id="87vtjg" data-start="369" data-end="390">About Dipesh Aryal</h2>\n<p data-start="392" data-end="754"><strong data-start="392" data-end="408">Dipesh Aryal</strong> is the Founder and Managing Director of Everpeak Adventure, a trusted trekking and tour company based in Nepal. He established the company with a clear vision of providing safe, reliable, and unforgettable travel experiences. Since its beginning, Everpeak Adventure has focused on quality service, customer satisfaction, and responsible tourism.</p>\n<p data-start="756" data-end="1084">Growing up in Nepal, Dipesh developed a deep appreciation for the Himalayas and the country's rich cultural heritage. Therefore, he decided to build a company that would introduce travelers from around the world to Nepal's natural beauty. His passion for adventure and hospitality continues to guide the company's mission today.</p>\n\n<h2 data-section-id="dwp13n" data-start="1086" data-end="1110">Vision and Leadership</h2>\n<p data-start="1112" data-end="1398">As the Managing Director, Dipesh oversees every part of the company's operations. He works closely with the team to ensure every trek and tour is well organized. In addition, he carefully reviews itineraries, travel arrangements, and customer support to maintain high service standards.</p>\n<p data-start="1400" data-end="1737">Moreover, Dipesh believes that every traveler deserves honest information and personalized assistance. For this reason, Everpeak Adventure offers carefully planned trips that combine adventure, comfort, and local experiences. His leadership has helped the company build lasting relationships with travelers from many different countries.</p>\n\n<h2 data-section-id="15xjpm8" data-start="1739" data-end="1763">Commitment to Quality</h2>\n<p data-start="1765" data-end="2021">Under Dipesh's leadership, Everpeak Adventure offers a wide range of trekking and tour packages across Nepal. These include the Everest Base Camp Trek, Annapurna Base Camp Trek, Langtang Valley Trek, Manaslu Circuit Trek, and many other popular adventures.</p>\n<p data-start="2023" data-end="2279">Furthermore, safety is always the company's highest priority. Every itinerary is designed with careful planning and attention to detail. The team also works with experienced guides and local experts to provide professional service throughout every journey.</p>\n\n<h2 data-section-id="3dyi7l" data-start="2281" data-end="2313">Promoting Responsible Tourism</h2>\n<p data-start="2315" data-end="2572">Dipesh strongly supports responsible and sustainable tourism. He believes that travel should benefit both visitors and local communities. Therefore, Everpeak Adventure encourages respectful cultural experiences and environmentally friendly travel practices.</p>\n<p data-start="2574" data-end="2785">In addition, the company works with local guides, porters, and accommodation providers whenever possible. This approach helps support local families while giving travelers authentic experiences throughout Nepal.</p>\n\n<h2 data-section-id="13dcvnv" data-start="2787" data-end="2803">Looking Ahead</h2>\n<p data-start="2805" data-end="3143">Today, <strong data-start="2812" data-end="2828">Dipesh Aryal</strong> continues to lead Everpeak Adventure with dedication and integrity. His goal is to inspire more people to explore the Himalayas with confidence. Finally, he remains committed to delivering exceptional service, creating unforgettable adventures, and sharing the beauty of Nepal with travelers from around the world.</p>	0	2026-08-23 02:08:08.063	2026-08-23 02:08:08.063	t
\.
COPY public."TermsPageContent" (id, title, subtitle, "contentHtml", "updatedAt", published) FROM stdin;
1520caa4-1437-4472-8843-ab93b986cccd	Terms and Conditions	Have questions or ready to plan your Himalayan adventure? Our friendly and experienced team is here to help you every step of the way.	\n        <div class="space-y-6 text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">\n          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 oswald mb-4">Booking & Payment Conditions</h2>\n          <p>Please read these terms and conditions carefully before booking any trek, tour, or climbing expedition with Ever Peak Adventures. By booking a trip with us, you accept these terms in full.</p>\n          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 oswald mt-6 mb-2">1. Deposits and Payments</h3>\n          <p>To secure a booking, a non-refundable deposit of 20% of the total trip cost is required upon confirmation. The remaining balance can be paid upon arrival in Kathmandu prior to departure.</p>\n          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 oswald mt-6 mb-2">2. Cancellations and Refunds</h3>\n          <p>If you need to cancel your trip, notice must be given in writing. Cancellation fees apply depending on how close to the departure date notice is received. We strongly recommend comprehensive travel insurance covering trip cancellation.</p>\n          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 oswald mt-6 mb-2">3. Health and Fitness</h3>\n          <p>Clients must disclose any medical conditions or physical limitations at the time of booking. Our itineraries involve high-altitude trekking where medical facilities can be remote.</p>\n        </div>\n      	2026-08-08 00:03:43.621	t
\.
